WEBVTT

00:56.875 --> 00:57.833
SHANGHAI BARBER SHOP

01:06.458 --> 01:07.291
Shit!

01:20.708 --> 01:21.875
Thanks.

01:22.000 --> 01:24.166
-Kiss me, Happy.
-Kiss me.

01:25.541 --> 01:26.791
Okay.

01:27.041 --> 01:30.583
-Who likes to go first?
-Me.

01:30.666 --> 01:32.416
-Let me try first.
-Okay, settle among yourselves.

01:32.500 --> 01:34.916
-Me first.
-Me first.

01:44.875 --> 01:45.875
Turn around.

01:46.166 --> 01:47.958
Wow, you're beautiful.

02:03.375 --> 02:04.583
It stinks!

02:05.333 --> 02:08.416
Sir, all the flies here will be extinct.

02:08.666 --> 02:09.500
Why?

02:09.875 --> 02:11.500
Killing flies will be our pastime.

02:11.666 --> 02:12.958
Chill, it won't be long.

02:13.791 --> 02:15.500
Over a hundred dollars for a cut!

02:16.000 --> 02:18.958
They don't shave, they don't massage,

02:19.416 --> 02:23.666
and they don't even do ear candling!
You tell me, how many idiots

02:25.041 --> 02:27.291
would go there to do their hair.
They would be foolish!

02:27.541 --> 02:29.333
It's classy!

02:30.541 --> 02:31.708
Let me give you a kiss.

02:32.333 --> 02:35.333
It's ruined! Do it again.

02:35.416 --> 02:36.458
Okay.

02:37.208 --> 02:39.708
SHANGHAI BARBER SHOP

02:41.291 --> 02:42.166
We're here, sir.

02:46.833 --> 02:48.291
Back up five feet at once!

02:48.625 --> 02:50.708
This is 30 Cheong Lok Street.

02:50.791 --> 02:53.000
Just do as I tell you.

02:53.083 --> 02:55.041
Reverse by exactly five feet!

02:56.666 --> 02:57.500
Jeez.

03:01.416 --> 03:02.458
That was crazy!

03:03.291 --> 03:05.250
Wow, that's incredible!

03:05.333 --> 03:08.291
-Here.
-No, it's okay. You may have it back.

03:08.375 --> 03:10.375
You are a fortune teller, right?

03:10.458 --> 03:14.291
Where is your stall? What's your name?
l need your sage advice.

03:15.333 --> 03:18.083
I'm Puddin Lai,
the 18th generation of Lai Prophets.

03:18.458 --> 03:20.250
Fate will decide if we meet again.

03:20.333 --> 03:23.250
If it does, I'll advise you

03:23.333 --> 03:25.500
to keep out from misfortune again.

03:29.291 --> 03:31.083
Sir, why didn't you predict that?

03:31.166 --> 03:33.083
l unveiled heaven's secrets for you,

03:33.541 --> 03:35.291
so I took the hit for your sake.

03:35.375 --> 03:36.916
-Really?
-Of course.

03:37.041 --> 03:38.250
Thank you, master.

03:38.750 --> 03:41.791
-Master Lai.
-Master Lai, thank you.

03:46.541 --> 03:49.666
l sense something alarming.

03:56.333 --> 03:58.375
And it's coming from this direction.

03:58.458 --> 04:00.458
I'm going to charge.

04:04.708 --> 04:06.333
-I'm going to cut.
-I charge.

04:06.416 --> 04:07.791
-Come out and help!
-Charge.

04:07.875 --> 04:09.208
I cut.

04:09.291 --> 04:11.666
Hold it, what are you cutting?

04:13.083 --> 04:14.666
Okay, count me out.

04:20.500 --> 04:21.500
"Charge."

04:21.750 --> 04:22.750
Charge your ass!

04:23.500 --> 04:27.291
-Excuse me. Happy!
-Whatever you say. Hey!

04:27.375 --> 04:29.708
Look at your hair. What gel did you use?

04:31.208 --> 04:33.708
Forget about that, but the barber
next door is so evil!

04:33.791 --> 04:35.541
You know that?
Luckily l got through unscathed.

04:35.625 --> 04:39.041
Today, l averted two misfortunes.
Consider me lucky. Oh, no!

04:40.041 --> 04:41.125
-What is it?
-What's wrong?

04:41.208 --> 04:42.125
Is it a third one?

04:42.208 --> 04:43.041
What date is it?

04:43.125 --> 04:44.583
-The ninth.
-Stop talking.

04:44.666 --> 04:46.416
Oh, no, there is a third misfortune!

04:46.500 --> 04:48.458
Luckily, I'm not getting it,
but it Big Eye is.

04:48.833 --> 04:49.666
What?

05:02.875 --> 05:04.500
Congratulations!

05:04.750 --> 05:06.416
May your new shop grow and thrive,

05:06.500 --> 05:08.166
and let your fine craft earn you big.

05:08.291 --> 05:10.250
Congratulations!

05:16.166 --> 05:18.041
Sorry, I was mistaken.

05:18.541 --> 05:19.583
I got the wrong shop.

05:20.666 --> 05:24.166
But it still applies here,
just like it does everywhere.

05:24.250 --> 05:27.250
Anyway, may your new shop
grow and thrive...

05:30.416 --> 05:31.250
Congratulations.

05:32.541 --> 05:33.458
Congratulations.

05:38.291 --> 05:39.750
You're pretty skillful.

05:41.875 --> 05:44.416
Kid, come back here! Did you play with me?

05:44.916 --> 05:45.791
No, I didn't.

05:45.875 --> 05:47.875
-Yes, you did it on purpose!
-I didn't mean it.

05:48.000 --> 05:48.833
Yes, you did!

05:48.916 --> 05:49.916
Shave his eyebrows!

05:51.708 --> 05:53.000
-Spray.
-Spray.

05:53.083 --> 05:54.875
-Come here, Big Eye.
-Come here, Big Eye.

05:56.583 --> 05:59.333
Come back! Spray them!

05:59.583 --> 06:00.500
Spray that old man!

06:00.583 --> 06:01.708
-Spray them!
-Stop it!

06:01.916 --> 06:03.875
-Miss!
-What now?

06:06.250 --> 06:07.208
Dad.

06:09.000 --> 06:11.583
-Dad.
-I'm not your dad, he is.

06:11.666 --> 06:14.250
Dad, what happened to you?

06:14.333 --> 06:16.250
Why did you pick a fight with them?

06:16.833 --> 06:18.541
Look what they did to his brow.

06:19.125 --> 06:22.500
Your dad is not going down without a fight

06:22.708 --> 06:26.166
because he's got a heart of steel. See!

06:26.750 --> 06:27.833
I'm going to get you!

06:30.416 --> 06:31.416
Bravo!

06:31.500 --> 06:33.041
That was awesome!

06:34.833 --> 06:36.166
Bravo!

06:37.416 --> 06:38.500
Bravo!

06:44.541 --> 06:45.416
Go to hell.

06:46.458 --> 06:47.541
What are you turds looking at?

06:50.083 --> 06:52.125
What are you looking at? Ying, go in!

06:52.708 --> 06:53.791
I'm not through with you yet.

06:53.875 --> 06:54.833
Nothing to see!

06:57.000 --> 06:57.833
Go inside.

06:57.916 --> 06:59.958
-Let's go back inside!
-Let's go back.

07:00.083 --> 07:02.166
Don't bother them!

07:02.250 --> 07:05.583
So pure and fresh.

07:05.666 --> 07:06.750
Fresh.

07:07.291 --> 07:09.583
I can tell by her eyebrows,
nose, and forehead

07:09.875 --> 07:12.500
that she's a walking lucky charm!

07:12.583 --> 07:14.875
Ying, I'll marry you for sure!

07:14.958 --> 07:16.875
-Ying, I'm so sorry.
-Hey.

07:17.041 --> 07:18.458
Let me apologize on their behalf.

07:20.333 --> 07:21.416
What do the gods say...

07:21.500 --> 07:22.625
What's your prediction for him?

07:22.875 --> 07:23.708
It's bad.

07:30.333 --> 07:31.375
Worse than I predicted.

07:34.708 --> 07:38.083
I'm going to find some love this year!

07:38.166 --> 07:39.000
Hey!

07:51.833 --> 07:55.541
-See? Look what you did to us.
-Me?

07:55.625 --> 07:57.833
You made this mess, so you go clean it up.

07:58.000 --> 07:59.416
Go and apologize right now!

08:00.458 --> 08:03.000
-You know what my instinct tells me?
-What?

08:03.083 --> 08:04.166
Never go in!

08:04.250 --> 08:05.416
You mucked up, so you fix it!

08:05.500 --> 08:07.041
-Even if you have to pay for it.
-Pay for it?

08:07.125 --> 08:08.083
-Yes!
-Hey.

08:08.708 --> 08:12.083
Who knows,
Ying would be touched if you're sincere.

08:12.375 --> 08:13.208
Touched?

08:13.625 --> 08:15.083
-Sure.
-Yes.

08:15.166 --> 08:16.833
So I can't pass the buck to you.

08:16.916 --> 08:18.666
-I'll have to shoulder it myself.
-We'll help you.

08:18.750 --> 08:20.583
Okay, hurry along now.

08:21.416 --> 08:23.541
Remember, Jesus is with you.

08:23.625 --> 08:25.083
So are the Bodhisattvas.

08:28.291 --> 08:29.333
Bodhisattvas, help me.

08:38.250 --> 08:39.541
Hi, guys.

08:46.708 --> 08:48.083
Sir, let me explain.

08:51.666 --> 08:54.166
Wow, you're closing early?

08:56.041 --> 09:00.666
No... I didn't mean that.
Slip of the tongue.

09:01.208 --> 09:03.750
Sir, I've come to apologize to you.

09:09.166 --> 09:10.250
-Sir.
-Dad.

09:26.375 --> 09:28.541
Dad, please don't.

09:29.458 --> 09:31.500
For over 19 years in business,

09:31.583 --> 09:33.500
I never shaved an eyebrow by accident

09:33.750 --> 09:36.375
until this day. Watch.

09:36.750 --> 09:39.208
I'm going to shave both your eyebrows
to make up for one of mine.

09:39.291 --> 09:40.625
What, both of them?

09:42.708 --> 09:45.416
Sir, instead of eyebrows,

09:45.500 --> 09:46.375
please shave my beard.

09:46.875 --> 09:50.083
Or if that's not okay with you,
I'll compensate in cash.

09:53.416 --> 09:54.833
-Thanks.
-How much?

09:55.291 --> 09:56.125
One hundred dollars.

09:59.000 --> 10:01.500
Five hundred dollars!
One hundred dollars each, okay?

10:07.250 --> 10:09.541
That sounds good enough. Now, pay up!

10:13.625 --> 10:14.500
It's going to be fine.

10:15.291 --> 10:17.041
Dad, no...

10:30.708 --> 10:32.750
-Run for it!
-You guys!

10:39.083 --> 10:40.583
I'll fix it with makeup.

10:59.541 --> 11:02.166
Oh, no. It looks distorted.

11:04.125 --> 11:08.375
No, you drew it great.

11:10.458 --> 11:11.666
You did really fine.

11:17.208 --> 11:20.166
What's keeping him? He's out of luck now.

11:21.041 --> 11:23.500
They could've castrated him by now.

11:24.458 --> 11:25.791
He has guts but no wit.

11:25.958 --> 11:29.208
-He's not good enough to flirt with girls.
-Too bad about that.

11:30.916 --> 11:32.916
I'll draw it up next time. Sorry.

11:34.916 --> 11:36.916
-He did it?
-I can't believe my eyes.

11:41.125 --> 11:42.208
-Be careful.
-Hey.

11:43.833 --> 11:44.708
He looks different.

11:44.833 --> 11:47.208
Yes, something's different. What is it?

11:47.458 --> 11:48.291
I'm much taller.

11:50.041 --> 11:52.416
-Yes. Taller.
-Yes. Taller.

12:01.500 --> 12:05.500
How about this hairstyle
for the semifinals?

12:07.625 --> 12:10.250
Would you like this omega style?

12:10.708 --> 12:11.750
Yes!

12:11.833 --> 12:12.666
It's this one then.

12:12.750 --> 12:14.791
Go do that hair for Mommy.

12:18.125 --> 12:19.708
Ying, take a rest.

12:19.791 --> 12:20.958
Have some refreshments.

12:21.916 --> 12:23.750
Do you mind, Ms. Shanghai?

12:23.833 --> 12:24.958
Her 30 minutes aren't up yet.

12:25.041 --> 12:27.500
What, you want her to die exhausted?

12:29.083 --> 12:31.250
l say, take a rest.

12:33.000 --> 12:35.041
Don't you want her to win?

12:35.416 --> 12:37.166
It's one million dollars, you know.

12:37.500 --> 12:39.750
She would also be able to
marry a rich guy.

12:40.125 --> 12:42.583
Dad, what matters most
is that my future husband

12:42.666 --> 12:46.083
will love me,
and I'll love him back, that's all.

12:46.666 --> 12:48.458
He doesn't have to be rich.

12:48.541 --> 12:51.541
That's right! Don't think you can
milk money out of our daughter.

12:52.458 --> 12:53.666
That's what women think.

12:54.958 --> 12:56.833
SHANGHAI BARBER SHOP

12:56.916 --> 12:59.208
DREAM OF THE RED CHAMBER

12:59.291 --> 13:00.291
-Have a seat.
-Thanks.

13:04.708 --> 13:05.791
Sir, please.

13:10.375 --> 13:11.708
Stinky tofu!

13:12.875 --> 13:14.083
Who wants some stinky tofu?

13:14.750 --> 13:16.416
What's up?

13:16.500 --> 13:18.625
Come on, let's eat together!

13:19.000 --> 13:21.958
Sir, I'm sure you like this.

13:22.750 --> 13:24.375
You too.

13:24.500 --> 13:26.083
Have some chili sauce.

13:26.208 --> 13:27.416
Help yourself.

13:27.541 --> 13:29.958
Here you go. This is the smelliest.

13:32.000 --> 13:34.625
Sir, I've come here just to apologize

13:34.708 --> 13:36.541
and get my hair shampooed.

13:38.041 --> 13:38.875
Enjoy.

13:38.958 --> 13:39.958
Help yourself.

13:40.375 --> 13:44.500
-Ying, try one.
-No, thanks. I don't eat this.

13:44.583 --> 13:45.958
You don't like it?

13:46.458 --> 13:48.166
Do you want to shampoo? Right this way.

13:48.708 --> 13:51.083
Why isn't she...

13:53.166 --> 13:55.500
It's so nice of you to do the honors.

13:55.875 --> 13:56.916
-Fook!
-Yes?

13:57.125 --> 13:58.375
-It's yours.
-Okay.

13:59.916 --> 14:01.708
-Shampoo?
-Your hand!

14:04.250 --> 14:05.125
Rinse.

14:07.416 --> 14:08.375
That way.

14:08.791 --> 14:09.625
Ying.

14:09.916 --> 14:12.291
Go on.

14:12.458 --> 14:13.291
Sir!

14:16.041 --> 14:17.750
l present you this fortune tiger.

14:17.833 --> 14:20.208
It will bring you money.

14:20.333 --> 14:22.208
Is my business not doing well now?

14:22.750 --> 14:24.041
Your business is surely brisk.

14:24.125 --> 14:25.958
But money is never too much, right?

14:26.041 --> 14:28.125
Where shall we place this fortune tiger?

14:31.625 --> 14:33.541
This is a good area.

14:34.583 --> 14:36.166
Good for money.

14:36.541 --> 14:38.791
This place is good for money,
not good for sex.

14:40.833 --> 14:43.250
You do have a good sense of humor.

14:43.333 --> 14:45.958
In fact, I've come to apologize

14:46.041 --> 14:48.000
and have my hair shampooed as well.

14:48.125 --> 14:50.541
Shampoo over there, and payment here.

14:59.083 --> 14:59.916
Shampoo?

15:00.625 --> 15:01.791
To have my eyebrow drawn.

15:04.583 --> 15:05.458
Your eyebrow?

15:05.541 --> 15:09.625
Sir, Ying, these flowers
are so beautiful, I'd like to...

15:09.833 --> 15:11.958
Yes, I like these flowers.

15:12.541 --> 15:13.708
Especially for you, sir.

15:14.500 --> 15:16.500
-Ying, this--
-Don't you want a shampoo?

15:17.458 --> 15:18.541
Go.

15:19.208 --> 15:20.416
Don't touch my stuff.

15:20.583 --> 15:21.708
I'll have a shampoo first.

15:22.208 --> 15:23.416
Ying, draw it.

15:25.416 --> 15:27.250
-Is your place of work nearby?
-Yes.

15:27.333 --> 15:28.666
-Just off work?
-Yes.

15:29.083 --> 15:32.000
Why would anyone be at work this late?

15:34.416 --> 15:36.500
Why don't you go to
Grassy Salon next door?

15:39.458 --> 15:41.625
Don't mention that, sir.

15:41.708 --> 15:45.000
They are reckless over there.
They would pull and pluck your hair.

15:45.083 --> 15:47.458
Their shampoo would cause
your hair to fall off.

15:47.666 --> 15:50.000
-Is that true?
-Really.

15:51.041 --> 15:52.875
-A lot of people said that, right?
-Yes.

15:54.333 --> 15:55.291
Bullshit.

15:56.333 --> 15:59.250
Your friend seems to be exaggerating.

15:59.625 --> 16:01.541
He is always like that,

16:01.625 --> 16:03.458
spewing bullshit most of the time.

16:03.541 --> 16:04.375
What?

16:04.458 --> 16:07.041
But this time, he tells the whole truth.

16:07.791 --> 16:09.083
l know.

16:10.833 --> 16:12.791
Don't move about like a child, okay?

16:13.583 --> 16:17.375
You shouldn't talk
behind your friend's back like that.

16:17.791 --> 16:20.666
It's not that I'm not being nice,
but those are the facts.

16:20.833 --> 16:23.041
Grassy, what a lousy name.

16:23.291 --> 16:25.916
Their skills are no match to what
this Shanghai master can do.

16:26.000 --> 16:27.500
-Right?
-Yes.

16:27.875 --> 16:30.125
Sir, when you see our hairstylist friend,

16:30.208 --> 16:32.458
ask him which is better,
Grassy or Shanghai?

16:33.125 --> 16:34.750
He will surely say Shanghai.

16:34.875 --> 16:38.416
Shut up! You pigs! Rats!

16:38.833 --> 16:40.875
So, there you are.

16:40.958 --> 16:42.333
Now, be honest.

16:42.416 --> 16:43.750
Is Shanghai better than Grassy?

16:43.833 --> 16:45.375
-Is it?
-How dare you say no!

16:45.541 --> 16:46.375
No!

16:48.500 --> 16:50.250
l mean yes.

16:51.958 --> 16:54.000
You see! Sir, l was right.

16:54.083 --> 16:55.041
Sit down.

17:00.458 --> 17:02.333
Well, since you three are so appreciative,

17:02.416 --> 17:04.000
l myself will do your hair.

17:04.083 --> 17:05.625
-How nice of you, sir.
-How nice of you, sir.

17:06.000 --> 17:07.458
-Thank you, Ying.
-Thank you, Ying.

17:16.416 --> 17:17.541
Hey, don't go in.

17:17.625 --> 17:20.041
You animal!

17:20.125 --> 17:22.666
-You ingrate!
-Like he said.

17:22.750 --> 17:23.625
Get lost!

17:23.708 --> 17:26.500
Cool it!
Just let us in as customers. All right?

17:26.583 --> 17:28.041
Don't take it so seriously.

17:28.125 --> 17:29.625
You saw what happened, we were joking.

17:29.708 --> 17:32.125
-Yes, we're just fooling around.
-Why are you fooling around?

17:32.875 --> 17:33.708
We're just...

17:35.041 --> 17:36.666
What a hairstyle!

17:39.000 --> 17:40.125
Get inside.

17:42.208 --> 17:44.041
You look like a country bumpkin.

17:49.791 --> 17:52.541
Did the Shanghai barber trick you?

17:52.666 --> 17:54.291
I don't see a single trace of Ying.

17:54.666 --> 17:57.708
l gave the barber 100 bucks,
he was so grateful.

17:57.791 --> 17:58.625
Did he cheat us?

17:58.708 --> 18:02.583
No! l dreamed of peach blossoms
floating on the river.

18:02.958 --> 18:04.958
l am sure I'll get a girl this time.

18:14.250 --> 18:15.375
Ying.

18:16.875 --> 18:18.833
-Ying! What a coincidence.
-What a coincidence.

18:18.916 --> 18:21.375
-It's the Shanghai barber--
-No, fate brought us together.

18:21.458 --> 18:24.500
Ying, are they your relatives?

18:24.875 --> 18:27.625
No, they are my students.

18:27.708 --> 18:29.833
l teach them swimming during holidays.

18:30.583 --> 18:32.375
-Let's warm up.
-Good.

18:33.000 --> 18:33.833
Come here.

18:36.416 --> 18:37.916
Please teach us.

18:38.958 --> 18:41.333
Let's have fun together. Good.

18:41.708 --> 18:44.791
One, two, three...

18:45.916 --> 18:48.750
Two, three...

18:48.833 --> 18:51.833
-Look, they are doing it all wrong.
-Three, two...

18:51.916 --> 18:54.500
-They are just staring at the teacher.
-Three, that's it.

18:54.583 --> 18:56.750
-Who knows what they are thinking.
-Four, two...

18:57.916 --> 19:00.250
-l know what you are thinking.
-Five, two, three.

19:01.041 --> 19:02.083
You do?

19:02.875 --> 19:03.958
You want to dab Ying.

19:04.708 --> 19:06.416
"Dab"? What does that mean?

19:08.541 --> 19:11.958
Dab means say hello to her.

19:12.041 --> 19:13.666
-Is that right?
-Yes.

19:13.750 --> 19:16.916
Thanks. "Dab." l got it.

19:17.375 --> 19:19.375
-He's fooling the teacher again.
-Yes.

19:21.250 --> 19:22.083
Class...

19:22.166 --> 19:24.333
Let's practice your
breathing techniques now. Okay?

19:24.416 --> 19:26.583
-Yes!
-Yes!

19:29.458 --> 19:31.791
-Miss, l don't know how to breathe.
-There you go.

19:31.875 --> 19:33.083
All right, I'll teach you.

19:33.166 --> 19:35.541
-Let me do it for you.
-Let me do it for you.

19:37.666 --> 19:38.750
Hi, kid.

19:39.583 --> 19:42.125
How are you going to be a man
if you can't draw breath?

19:42.208 --> 19:43.708
It's so simple.

19:43.791 --> 19:46.666
l can hold my breath
and submerge for an hour--

19:46.750 --> 19:49.500
No! Just half an hour for one breath,

19:49.583 --> 19:52.250
l can swim across the harbor.

19:52.375 --> 19:54.083
-Liar.
-Don't make a fool out of the kids.

19:54.208 --> 19:56.916
Yes, you're all talk and no action.

19:57.000 --> 19:58.208
Right. Can you do it?

19:58.291 --> 19:59.958
Why not? Go ahead.

20:00.125 --> 20:04.041
-Let's test our endurance.
-Let's see who will die of exhaustion.

20:04.125 --> 20:05.291
-We will have a race.
-Okay!

20:05.375 --> 20:07.500
Children, you will be our judges. Okay?

20:07.583 --> 20:09.625
-Okay!
-Okay!

20:09.708 --> 20:10.833
Ying, you will be the referee.

20:10.958 --> 20:14.041
All right, let us watch them.

20:21.916 --> 20:24.541
Miss, I would like to see
if they will break the rules.

20:24.625 --> 20:25.791
Right, go ahead.

20:30.208 --> 20:32.958
They breathe out beautiful bubbles.

20:33.333 --> 20:34.166
Really?

20:41.208 --> 20:42.083
-Miss
-What?

20:42.166 --> 20:43.625
They speak vulgar language.

20:43.791 --> 20:46.041
How could you hear them underwater?

20:46.625 --> 20:48.375
They were growling at each other.

20:52.083 --> 20:54.833
-Miss. They must be thirsty.
-What?

20:55.625 --> 20:56.750
Why?

20:57.833 --> 20:59.500
They took in so much water.

21:00.541 --> 21:01.500
Really?

21:04.166 --> 21:05.625
-Miss.
-What?

21:05.875 --> 21:08.333
They look like fish in my aquarium.

21:08.833 --> 21:09.666
Like what?

21:10.041 --> 21:11.208
Their eyes stick out.

21:13.166 --> 21:15.291
How are they? Are they okay?

21:15.541 --> 21:17.250
Don't press, children!

21:27.916 --> 21:29.583
What would you like to drink?

21:29.750 --> 21:31.708
-Oh, no thank you.
-Oh, no thank you.

21:34.750 --> 21:35.625
Ying!

21:36.958 --> 21:38.541
You like conducting
swimming lessons for kids?

21:38.625 --> 21:42.041
Yes, I like children a lot,
and it's summer vacation now.

21:42.208 --> 21:44.750
I can keep fit as I train them.

21:45.458 --> 21:49.666
The Miss Hong Kong contest is next month.

21:49.750 --> 21:51.541
-Miss Hong Kong.
-Miss Hong Kong.

21:52.000 --> 21:54.791
l got in the semifinals.

21:55.458 --> 21:58.625
How nice! l am an insurance agent,

21:58.708 --> 22:01.125
l can help you to make the right decision.

22:01.750 --> 22:02.583
Hey.

22:02.666 --> 22:05.666
You look very smart.

22:05.875 --> 22:08.083
You got the swag like a queen.

22:08.250 --> 22:10.166
Let me have a touch, just to be sure...

22:10.458 --> 22:12.958
I wonder how many times
you've used the same old trick.

22:13.041 --> 22:14.708
-To take advantage of someone?
-Hey.

22:14.958 --> 22:17.083
Are you asking her to bare all for you?

22:17.166 --> 22:18.291
Shame on you.

22:18.375 --> 22:19.583
Don't get any ideas!

22:19.666 --> 22:21.166
He has a dirty mind.

22:22.166 --> 22:23.708
He's like that.

22:24.500 --> 22:25.958
He's always like that.

22:26.041 --> 22:27.708
Ying, I'm Kei Ho Yan.

22:28.041 --> 22:29.166
I'm Chan Hoi Sum.

22:29.250 --> 22:31.083
-You can call me Big Eye.
-Remember me.

22:31.375 --> 22:32.458
I'm studying fashion design.

22:32.750 --> 22:34.041
I'll be a hairstylist.

22:34.666 --> 22:36.083
l can design an evening gown for you.

22:39.458 --> 22:42.125
l can create the perfect hairstyle
for you.

22:42.208 --> 22:43.333
Let me help you.

22:45.958 --> 22:49.291
Sir, here's five bucks for you.

22:49.916 --> 22:51.958
Don't bring me the bill.

22:52.875 --> 22:54.000
Sure, no problem.

22:54.291 --> 22:57.333
-Trust me, I'll create a new hairstyle.
-Will you stop talking?

22:57.416 --> 23:00.083
-We're almost finished. Bill please.
-Coming.

23:00.166 --> 23:01.708
-Here!
-Thanks.

23:01.791 --> 23:04.541
Let me pay the bill.

23:04.625 --> 23:05.791
Allow me.

23:05.875 --> 23:07.416
No, let me pay.

23:07.541 --> 23:08.708
No, let me pay.

23:08.791 --> 23:11.500
You're too modest. I told you I'll pay.

23:13.000 --> 23:15.875
-You're too kind.
-Let me pay.

23:15.958 --> 23:17.000
Stop snatching it.

23:17.083 --> 23:18.958
Hey, don't grip so tight.
How am I going to give them?

23:19.041 --> 23:20.500
It's my turn.

23:22.958 --> 23:24.625
Why don't you pay?

23:26.625 --> 23:27.833
You seldom pay.

23:29.291 --> 23:30.416
What now?

23:30.625 --> 23:34.458
It means l pay! Why ask a stupid question?

23:34.541 --> 23:35.958
Do l have to pay you back?

23:36.666 --> 23:37.500
Keep the change!

23:37.583 --> 23:39.458
-Yes, keep the change.
-Thank you!

23:39.541 --> 23:40.625
Thank you, sir.

23:46.250 --> 23:48.208
SHANGHAI BARBER SHOP

23:54.833 --> 23:55.666
Ying.

24:04.083 --> 24:05.375
It's for you, sir.

24:05.958 --> 24:08.000
Next time, no flowers. Just cash.

24:08.416 --> 24:09.833
Sir, l thought about it the whole night

24:09.916 --> 24:10.833
and decided...

24:11.458 --> 24:12.291
Hold your horses!

24:13.083 --> 24:14.250
To give you this.

24:16.625 --> 24:17.625
Is it suitable for me?

24:17.833 --> 24:21.625
Only two men in the world
are fit to use it.

24:21.708 --> 24:24.958
One is Stallone, and the other is you.

24:25.166 --> 24:26.250
Really?

24:27.958 --> 24:28.791
What Stallone?

24:28.875 --> 24:31.291
Stallone, Rambo!

24:37.458 --> 24:38.958
Great swordsmanship!

24:47.166 --> 24:48.583
It's sharp.

24:49.125 --> 24:51.166
He said Rambo used it.

24:52.541 --> 24:56.291
It's so sharp, it's terrific!

24:56.750 --> 24:58.625
One touch and you're finished!

25:00.291 --> 25:01.208
You see that?

25:02.333 --> 25:03.500
It's a great knife.

25:03.583 --> 25:05.666
It's so sharp, it cuts into your wallet.

25:06.958 --> 25:07.875
l know.

25:10.708 --> 25:12.166
l have got 200 dollars only.

25:13.500 --> 25:15.458
Even one eyebrow is worth 500 dollars.

25:21.333 --> 25:23.666
l have got a blank check.

25:23.750 --> 25:24.875
I'll fill in there.

25:24.958 --> 25:27.916
It sends chills to your back.

25:29.541 --> 25:31.416
It does. Got to go.

25:32.041 --> 25:33.208
Silly boy.

25:33.541 --> 25:34.958
Not so chilly now.

25:39.250 --> 25:40.125
-My girl.
-Yes.

25:40.208 --> 25:41.875
Do you like those three young men?

25:42.125 --> 25:45.041
No, we just met a few times.

25:45.250 --> 25:48.916
Right. Our daughter won't like such
ordinary men.

25:49.500 --> 25:52.041
Dad, please!

25:52.166 --> 25:55.125
Then, why did you invite them to dinner?

25:55.666 --> 25:57.541
To manipulate them.

25:57.791 --> 26:01.125
Those three would flirt with Ying

26:01.208 --> 26:02.250
with different excuses.

26:02.625 --> 26:04.541
I'll make use of the three dogs

26:04.625 --> 26:06.333
to help Ying in the beauty contest.

26:06.416 --> 26:08.666
What, three dogs?

26:08.750 --> 26:10.125
What do you take your daughter for?

26:11.041 --> 26:11.958
No.

26:12.500 --> 26:16.083
I would let the dogs watch each other.

26:17.041 --> 26:18.125
There they are.

26:24.250 --> 26:25.291
-Hi, Ying.
-Ying.

26:27.333 --> 26:28.958
-You're here!
-Sir!

26:29.791 --> 26:31.958
-This is a collector's edition.
-It's especially for you, sir.

26:32.041 --> 26:34.125
Oh, really.

26:34.583 --> 26:36.708
Just a small favor, sir.
This is the most expensive one.

26:36.791 --> 26:38.333
-It's just a little gift.
-Give it to Ying.

26:38.416 --> 26:39.833
-Take care of it.
-Ying, take care of it.

26:39.916 --> 26:41.125
Come in and sit down.

26:42.541 --> 26:44.333
-Honey, time for dinner.
-Sir.

26:44.416 --> 26:45.875
It's a beautiful house. Sir, l...

26:48.333 --> 26:49.250
Ma'am.

26:50.458 --> 26:51.875
My name is Puddin Lai.

26:51.958 --> 26:53.625
Ying must always mention me.

26:53.708 --> 26:56.291
Yes, you are the hairstylist, right!

26:56.375 --> 26:57.666
How's business lately?

26:58.750 --> 26:59.958
Not too bad.

27:01.333 --> 27:03.875
Ma'am, it smells good.
You're an excellent cook!

27:03.958 --> 27:06.083
Your minced beef looks,
smells, and tastes good!

27:06.166 --> 27:08.541
It's fried meatball.
Now, get out of my way.

27:08.625 --> 27:09.625
Sit outside.

27:10.250 --> 27:11.500
-Ma'am!
-Ma'am!

27:11.583 --> 27:14.041
-Let me give you a hand.
-You don't know fried meatballs! Out!

27:14.125 --> 27:17.458
-Let me help you.
-Let's go.

27:17.541 --> 27:18.958
-Have some tea.
-Thank you, Ying.

27:24.583 --> 27:27.875
By the way, Puddin,
how did you excel in feng shui,

27:27.958 --> 27:29.250
and palmistry?

27:29.458 --> 27:32.916
I'm an insurance agent, l study those

27:33.125 --> 27:34.416
in my spare time.

27:34.625 --> 27:36.541
Sir, let me read your palm.

27:40.333 --> 27:43.875
It's thick and fleshy. Nice.

27:44.041 --> 27:46.416
You're blessed,
that's why you have a pretty daughter.

27:46.500 --> 27:48.375
It's not every day I get to see this palm.

27:49.750 --> 27:51.958
Sir, can I follow Ying to her room?

27:54.500 --> 27:57.291
I would like to see her clothes
and how she dress up.

27:57.375 --> 27:58.625
Ying, let's go in.

27:59.166 --> 28:00.958
No hurry, some other day.

28:03.208 --> 28:05.083
l tried many brands of shampoo.

28:05.500 --> 28:07.083
I can't decide the right one for my hair.

28:07.458 --> 28:09.083
-Can you help me?
-Sure.

28:16.000 --> 28:17.666
My hair tends to be dry.

28:18.041 --> 28:20.875
You are right, you see, they split.

28:20.958 --> 28:22.458
-Quite a lot of splits.
-Yes.

28:22.625 --> 28:24.750
Split on your dead body.

28:24.916 --> 28:26.541
Who is dead?

28:26.916 --> 28:29.833
Oh, your palm marks escape from death.

28:29.916 --> 28:32.041
It means you're going to be rich.

28:32.666 --> 28:33.500
Not bad.

28:33.583 --> 28:34.666
Yes.

28:37.458 --> 28:39.125
It's all right.

28:39.291 --> 28:41.958
-I'll trim it every week, that'd be great.
-Cut the crap.

28:42.541 --> 28:43.583
Dinner time.

28:43.875 --> 28:45.666
May l sit with you, Ying?

28:45.750 --> 28:47.916
Sorry, move over.

28:48.000 --> 28:49.541
That's my seat. Sit over here.

28:49.625 --> 28:52.750
Ma'am.

28:53.333 --> 28:55.375
-So much food.
-Feel at home. Get started.

28:55.916 --> 28:58.041
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

28:58.125 --> 28:59.041
Mom.

28:59.166 --> 29:01.666
They have longed to dab you for some time.

29:04.791 --> 29:08.041
Dad, they've wanted to dab you too.

29:10.666 --> 29:12.208
Yes, we've wanted to dab your wine.

29:13.708 --> 29:14.833
Cheers.

29:15.125 --> 29:17.750
Thank you for coming to dab our family.

29:18.916 --> 29:20.708
Ying, watch your words!

29:21.500 --> 29:24.125
-Our pleasure!
-Our pleasure!

29:24.666 --> 29:25.916
-Cheers.
-Honey,

29:26.000 --> 29:27.583
you're so happy, why don't you drink?

29:28.083 --> 29:30.583
-Me?
-Yes, everyone's happy.

29:31.000 --> 29:32.000
-Okay.
-Okay.

29:32.666 --> 29:33.916
Great.

29:34.000 --> 29:35.208
Good drinker!

29:35.291 --> 29:37.208
Ma'am, have another glass.

29:37.333 --> 29:39.375
-l can't drink much.
-Just one more glass.

29:39.541 --> 29:41.416
-Doesn't matter, have another.
-Just one more.

29:41.708 --> 29:42.958
Drink it up.

29:43.416 --> 29:45.708
We're all very happy today.

29:46.125 --> 29:47.791
I'll just drink it up.

29:49.291 --> 29:50.208
Nice one!

29:52.708 --> 29:56.250
-You're such a good drinker.
-Go ahead while l go check the fish.

29:57.458 --> 29:59.541
-Sir, you are hospitable.
-Make yourselves at home.

29:59.625 --> 30:00.541
Dad.

30:03.166 --> 30:04.375
-Mom?
-Ma'am.

30:04.458 --> 30:05.541
Want to call an ambulance?

30:05.625 --> 30:07.833
Let's carry her altogether.

30:08.000 --> 30:09.666
She is too heavy.

30:15.416 --> 30:16.416
You are useless.

30:16.500 --> 30:18.416
Remove her, l can't breathe.

30:20.500 --> 30:22.458
Hey, you've drunk too much.

30:22.791 --> 30:25.000
-Sir, he took too much.
-Spit it back out.

30:26.500 --> 30:27.541
-Add some sauce.
-Spit it out.

30:28.958 --> 30:30.458
We're almost out. Let's see who gets it.

30:30.625 --> 30:32.750
Bring it on!

30:35.625 --> 30:36.750
Marlboro...

30:36.958 --> 30:38.041
Lemon tea...

30:38.125 --> 30:40.333
No air-con...

30:41.458 --> 30:42.750
-You lost.
-You lost.

30:42.833 --> 30:45.833
-The loser must drink.
-Drink it up.

30:46.041 --> 30:47.083
-One more time.
-No way!

30:47.166 --> 30:50.666
Okay. One more chance for you.

30:52.208 --> 30:54.916
No air-con...

30:56.500 --> 30:57.708
-Drink up.
-You must drink up!

30:57.791 --> 30:58.916
Drink up.

31:02.083 --> 31:04.750
-What are you waiting for?
-Just drink!

31:04.875 --> 31:05.708
No drink!

31:06.166 --> 31:07.875
You lost, you should drink.

31:07.958 --> 31:09.416
Yes, do it.

31:09.541 --> 31:11.208
-Drink.
-Do it.

31:11.291 --> 31:12.208
Silly boy.

31:12.291 --> 31:13.291
Drink it up.

31:13.416 --> 31:16.125
Don't be stubborn! Come, hold him.

31:16.458 --> 31:19.750
Open your mouth, relax.

31:19.833 --> 31:21.416
A little more, that's it.

31:22.208 --> 31:23.166
All done!

31:24.166 --> 31:25.250
Don't tease him.

31:25.333 --> 31:27.083
That was fun.

31:27.166 --> 31:28.166
You rascal!

31:28.500 --> 31:30.375
-Angry already?
-You get angry so easily?

31:30.666 --> 31:31.791
That's not manly of you.

31:31.875 --> 31:32.916
You're really angry?

31:34.291 --> 31:36.666
Not me!

31:36.791 --> 31:39.250
l like fun. Why are you angry?

31:41.375 --> 31:42.791
What are you up to?

31:43.958 --> 31:45.083
Not angry?

31:46.958 --> 31:48.000
Why would I be angry?

31:52.541 --> 31:54.250
It's gross!

32:01.125 --> 32:02.625
It's so comfy, why get angry?

32:03.958 --> 32:05.875
-Don't you like some fun?
-Certainly.

32:09.291 --> 32:10.625
An egg!

32:14.416 --> 32:15.541
What for?

32:16.416 --> 32:17.291
Stop that!

32:20.541 --> 32:22.125
l am not angry, not at all.

32:23.333 --> 32:24.500
Have some more fun!

32:25.541 --> 32:26.750
Come on, you have to do it.

32:28.125 --> 32:28.958
Come on.

32:30.708 --> 32:31.541
Just for fun.

32:31.708 --> 32:32.541
Go!

32:42.833 --> 32:44.958
Second round. Be quick!

32:56.833 --> 32:57.666
Ying!

33:06.708 --> 33:07.791
Bravo.

33:07.875 --> 33:10.166
Dad, that's enough.

33:10.250 --> 33:12.875
No one's suffocated yet. Carry on.

33:36.166 --> 33:37.041
Oh, no. Sir.

33:38.541 --> 33:39.375
Dad!

33:39.458 --> 33:40.375
Sorry for that, sir.

33:40.458 --> 33:43.083
-Look what you did!
-I'm so sorry, sir.

33:43.166 --> 33:44.083
He won't get angry.

33:44.166 --> 33:46.541
It's okay.

33:46.708 --> 33:48.583
His philtrum is so wide,
that means he's open-minded.

33:49.500 --> 33:52.083
Yes, he's not angry.
It's okay, he's open-minded.

33:52.166 --> 33:54.833
-Come, bottoms up!
-Bottoms up!

33:56.791 --> 34:00.750
Bottoms up!

34:00.833 --> 34:04.125
-Ying, let me send you home.
-I want to go to sleep.

34:04.833 --> 34:06.666
-Goodnight.
-Goodnight.

34:06.791 --> 34:10.041
-Ying...
-Go away.

34:11.291 --> 34:13.750
You people are useless. Have more.

34:16.833 --> 34:19.416
Where is Ying?

34:22.458 --> 34:23.500
Hey.

34:23.583 --> 34:26.541
Sir, we are leaving.

34:32.166 --> 34:35.916
The main door is not there, it's this way.

34:37.291 --> 34:38.375
This way.

34:40.041 --> 34:41.541
Bye, sir.

34:42.208 --> 34:46.125
-l need the toilet.
-Bye.

34:52.958 --> 34:55.541
-Where's the restroom?
-I'm in a hurry!

34:56.416 --> 34:59.500
Hang on, press the button.

35:00.291 --> 35:03.708
Wrong button!

35:03.958 --> 35:05.500
What's taking it so long?

35:06.000 --> 35:08.958
Just open the door.

35:11.083 --> 35:12.041
You first.

35:12.708 --> 35:13.541
You first.

35:14.541 --> 35:15.625
After you.

35:15.708 --> 35:17.958
No prizes for politeness.

35:20.541 --> 35:22.708
Why are there clothes in the elevator?

35:22.791 --> 35:24.791
Who doesn't hang clothes in elevators?

35:25.875 --> 35:27.291
Are you nuts?

35:28.125 --> 35:30.333
-This elevator is so small!
-It really hot!

35:31.666 --> 35:34.250
So people hang their clothes here.

35:34.333 --> 35:36.708
But there are only shirts here.
Where are the pants?

35:37.416 --> 35:38.833
Are we there?

35:39.750 --> 35:41.541
Push, stupid!

35:42.958 --> 35:44.333
We're here. Where are we?

35:44.416 --> 35:45.583
At Repulse Bay.

35:47.250 --> 35:49.833
The Caribbean Sea! Mermaid!

35:51.458 --> 35:52.416
Over there!

35:53.416 --> 35:54.541
Let's swim there.

35:56.208 --> 35:57.500
Butterfly stroke!

36:00.041 --> 36:01.250
Butterfly stroke.

36:02.541 --> 36:04.666
I'm freestyling, I'm coming!

36:04.750 --> 36:08.416
Help, I can't swim!
Give me a lifesaver or something!

36:08.625 --> 36:09.625
I want a lifesaver!

36:26.791 --> 36:27.958
What the hell's going on here?

36:29.375 --> 36:30.250
My clothes?

36:30.583 --> 36:33.666
-It almost killed me.
-Ying, what's the matter?

36:34.916 --> 36:39.458
Nothing, Dad, l had a bad dream!

36:40.333 --> 36:42.708
-Bad dream?
-A bad dream?

36:42.791 --> 36:43.666
-Did we...
-Go!

36:43.875 --> 36:44.875
It can't be!

36:45.500 --> 36:46.875
-Tell me what happened.
-Go!

36:46.958 --> 36:48.958
-Are you all right?
-Go away! Please go away!

36:49.041 --> 36:50.458
Go!

36:50.916 --> 36:51.958
What should we do?

36:52.041 --> 36:53.375
We will come back for you.

36:53.500 --> 36:54.958
Ying, don't cry.

36:57.916 --> 36:59.500
-We will be back.
-Yes.

37:09.666 --> 37:11.333
Who took advantage of her? Admit it!

37:11.500 --> 37:14.291
l had no part in anything last right.

37:14.375 --> 37:17.125
l slept so sound, nothing could wake me.

37:18.500 --> 37:22.250
Can't be me. l adore her so much.

37:22.666 --> 37:23.958
l wouldn't do anything indecent.

37:24.625 --> 37:28.666
We don't even know
whether anything happened.

37:30.041 --> 37:31.958
-It's not you?
-Of course not.

37:32.583 --> 37:33.416
It's not you?

37:33.916 --> 37:36.375
Then, it must be me.
Now that Ying is mine, that means

37:36.458 --> 37:37.791
you don't go after your friend's wife!

37:37.875 --> 37:40.250
You two should not even fancy her.

37:40.333 --> 37:43.750
Excuse me. I'll pay for this meal.

37:44.750 --> 37:45.916
Now l remember.

37:46.416 --> 37:47.875
Last night I had a chat with the mermaid,

37:48.416 --> 37:49.708
and boy we had such a great time.

37:49.791 --> 37:51.041
l think it was me.

37:51.166 --> 37:55.791
-Okay. l admit. It was me.
-Okay.

37:56.500 --> 37:58.750
l don't want to say it,
but now l won't hold back.

37:59.833 --> 38:02.041
Look, my whole body is sticky.

38:02.125 --> 38:04.041
-It's proof that I did it.
-You don't say.

38:04.125 --> 38:06.125
Look at my stained pants!

38:06.208 --> 38:07.666
It must have been me.

38:07.750 --> 38:10.750
Wait. Look here! It's all over my head.

38:10.958 --> 38:12.583
You've all admitted it.

38:12.666 --> 38:13.500
Hey.

38:13.958 --> 38:17.000
Then it was gang rape!

38:17.125 --> 38:20.833
What? Did he say gang rape?

38:22.208 --> 38:23.958
These young people don't have any shame!

38:24.041 --> 38:26.833
SHANGHAI BARBER SHOP

38:27.000 --> 38:29.041
-Hi, Happy!
-Hi.

38:29.250 --> 38:30.416
Please, go in.

38:38.458 --> 38:41.791
Ying, l want to...

39:06.333 --> 39:09.166
Heavens. I've never been
so sincere to a girl,

39:09.375 --> 39:10.791
and now I'm so heartbroken.

39:21.875 --> 39:22.916
Ying is paging us.

39:31.208 --> 39:33.166
Actually, l didn't want to see you again.

39:33.750 --> 39:36.458
But I feel strange lately.

39:40.166 --> 39:42.666
Take this for a test,
and tell me the results.

39:42.750 --> 39:43.875
As soon as you know.

39:44.708 --> 39:46.416
-Ying.
-Ying.

39:53.291 --> 39:54.791
What is this?

39:55.916 --> 39:56.916
Perfume.

39:57.500 --> 39:58.875
-Perfume?
-Try it.

40:05.041 --> 40:06.416
It's so strong.

40:07.416 --> 40:09.541
It's urine for the test.

40:09.625 --> 40:10.833
Why didn't you say so?

40:11.666 --> 40:12.583
Let's go.

40:13.458 --> 40:16.416
This is a bottle, not a barrel.

40:16.500 --> 40:18.083
It doesn't take three to carry.

40:18.458 --> 40:19.666
You do it tomorrow.

40:20.791 --> 40:24.875
Me again?
But I would do anything for Ying.

40:27.500 --> 40:29.333
If the test verifies this is draft beer.

40:29.500 --> 40:30.833
I can just drink it.

40:33.083 --> 40:34.500
Go take your samples at the toilet.

40:34.583 --> 40:40.166
INQUIRY

40:41.500 --> 40:42.333
Can l help you?

40:42.500 --> 40:43.375
Urine test.

40:43.458 --> 40:44.333
Put it on the tray.

40:48.000 --> 40:49.791
KEI HO YAN
PREGNANCY TEST

40:53.166 --> 40:55.208
What a coincidence! What's wrong with you?

40:55.458 --> 40:57.250
Oh, yes.

40:58.208 --> 40:59.666
l can't urinate.

41:00.416 --> 41:01.375
With due respect, sir.

41:01.541 --> 41:03.208
So is it VD?

41:03.291 --> 41:05.791
No! To see if there is a precipitant
in the urine.

41:06.208 --> 41:07.833
What are you testing for?

41:08.083 --> 41:09.541
Chronic diabetes, what else.

41:09.708 --> 41:10.583
Allow me.

41:10.666 --> 41:11.625
Have a seat.

41:13.833 --> 41:16.375
CHUK TAI CHUNG
DIABETES

41:22.583 --> 41:25.416
Big Eye, what's the test for?

41:25.500 --> 41:26.625
Why so tense?

41:28.041 --> 41:30.416
l don't know. Whatever will be, will be.

41:30.833 --> 41:32.333
Why so scared?

41:34.458 --> 41:35.500
I'm scared for you.

41:35.583 --> 41:37.500
-Kei Ho Yan!
-Yes!

41:40.125 --> 41:41.708
You have diabetes.

41:43.875 --> 41:44.958
Diabetes.

41:45.166 --> 41:46.750
Be calm. Is it serious?

41:46.833 --> 41:47.708
Is it serious?

41:47.791 --> 41:49.250
Ask a doctor.

41:52.500 --> 41:53.333
You ask a doctor.

41:53.416 --> 41:55.166
Right. Go and see a doctor.

41:59.666 --> 42:01.458
-Chuk Tai Chung.
-What's the result?

42:02.041 --> 42:03.333
Why so nosy?

42:03.750 --> 42:05.041
Congratulations.

42:05.125 --> 42:06.166
Congratulations?

42:08.083 --> 42:08.958
Oh, no.

42:09.041 --> 42:12.041
-What oh, no? He said congratulations.
-It's positive!

42:12.791 --> 42:14.000
Positive and you congratulate me?

42:14.208 --> 42:17.041
Be more careful from now on.

42:17.250 --> 42:20.208
Careful? At my age?

42:20.458 --> 42:23.166
l don't care.
Fat or skinny, I'll just eat.

42:23.250 --> 42:25.166
I'll take so far as I've got the urge.

42:25.250 --> 42:29.125
Sir, leave it.
This lab may not be reliable.

42:29.916 --> 42:31.083
Go elsewhere.

42:33.166 --> 42:34.041
Pregnancy test?

42:34.125 --> 42:35.375
Again!

42:46.958 --> 42:49.083
Congratulations on getting diabetes?
Are they nuts?

42:53.250 --> 42:56.291
Sir, check out these ads.

42:56.375 --> 42:58.833
We could find a cure
for your diabetes among them.

43:00.916 --> 43:01.750
Let's go.

43:01.833 --> 43:04.083
-What's the result?
-Sugar in the urine.

43:04.166 --> 43:06.666
Did you drink Ying's urine？

43:06.750 --> 43:07.708
You bastard.

43:08.375 --> 43:10.291
What? My Ying?

43:22.833 --> 43:24.583
How come you don't know?

43:24.791 --> 43:25.916
I'll question them.

43:29.541 --> 43:32.541
Who among you three did it?

43:36.291 --> 43:39.916
-For the last time, who did it?
-Answer now!

43:46.041 --> 43:47.791
Outrageous! Torture them!

43:52.958 --> 43:55.458
l don't want a gang rape scandal.

43:56.041 --> 43:57.875
If you inform me of the culprit,

43:57.958 --> 43:59.166
we will set you off.

43:59.250 --> 44:02.208
If not, I'll break your eardrums.

44:02.958 --> 44:06.791
How can I choose, sir?
If I don't point out who did it,

44:06.875 --> 44:08.208
you will break my eardrums.

44:08.708 --> 44:10.458
That's right! Who did it?

44:13.375 --> 44:14.416
You did it?

44:18.750 --> 44:20.208
-Did you do it?
-Yes or no?

44:25.458 --> 44:26.375
Go to hell!

44:40.625 --> 44:42.541
-How is it?
-Sit down!

44:43.458 --> 44:44.625
How is it?

44:44.708 --> 44:46.541
-How is it?
-Tell us.

44:46.625 --> 44:48.833
l am deaf!

44:48.916 --> 44:50.125
-You're deaf?
-You're deaf?

44:50.708 --> 44:51.750
Are you sure?

44:52.791 --> 44:54.750
How did he torture you?

44:54.833 --> 44:55.916
Can you hear?

44:56.000 --> 44:58.958
l can't!

44:59.041 --> 45:01.750
-You can't hear us?
-Never admit guilt!

45:02.791 --> 45:03.791
He is ruthless.

45:03.875 --> 45:05.791
Now what? Our turn will come.

45:05.875 --> 45:07.625
Puddin, come in.

45:08.083 --> 45:10.166
-What's it? Who is it?
-Me!

45:12.125 --> 45:13.125
Ying's mom is calling you.

45:13.208 --> 45:14.416
-You first.
-You!

45:14.500 --> 45:15.625
No, you first.

45:15.708 --> 45:17.416
My friend, listen to me.

45:19.458 --> 45:22.333
Don't ever plead guilty. Get me?

45:22.666 --> 45:25.041
Can you hear me?

45:26.583 --> 45:28.375
What? Who?

45:28.833 --> 45:32.291
-Did you do it? Talk!
-Did you?

45:32.833 --> 45:33.958
Talk!

45:38.916 --> 45:40.000
Go to hell!

45:54.291 --> 45:56.708
Why do you have to be so cruel?

45:57.250 --> 45:58.375
You're crueler.

45:59.083 --> 46:01.291
What's it going to be,
information or eardrum?

46:03.000 --> 46:04.625
I would rather not choose.

46:08.541 --> 46:09.666
Did you do it?

46:10.375 --> 46:11.416
Did you?

46:16.583 --> 46:17.458
Are you going to admit?

46:22.541 --> 46:23.875
Thanks for not breaking my eardrum.

46:24.041 --> 46:26.166
I'm not breaking your eardrums,
I'll smack you!

46:29.791 --> 46:33.833
That will teach you. Now, get out.

46:34.666 --> 46:36.916
They've really made fools out of us.

46:42.875 --> 46:45.041
Hey.

46:45.916 --> 46:48.333
Ying's dad spared me.

46:49.166 --> 46:50.041
What?

46:53.208 --> 46:56.291
Relax. Tomorrow I'll enroll you

46:56.375 --> 46:57.666
in the school for deaf and dumb.

47:01.458 --> 47:03.416
Your fart smells terrible!

47:03.500 --> 47:05.000
And it's so loud!

47:05.958 --> 47:07.708
You two played with me!

47:08.291 --> 47:10.291
How come you know nothing?

47:11.041 --> 47:13.750
-Mr. Shanghai, leave her alone!
-I don't care,

47:13.833 --> 47:15.000
I want it aborted!

47:15.083 --> 47:16.458
-Don't!
-Don't!

47:17.208 --> 47:19.833
No, l won't do it!

47:19.958 --> 47:21.041
Please, don't!

47:21.125 --> 47:22.541
You bitch, I'll hack you to pieces.

47:22.625 --> 47:23.625
Now, you abort it or die!

47:23.708 --> 47:26.541
-Ying, run away! Quick!
-Hurry, come along with us.

47:26.625 --> 47:28.125
Don't you run away!

47:28.333 --> 47:30.125
I'm going to report you for gang rape,

47:30.541 --> 47:32.291
so prepare to get your asses in jail!

47:33.000 --> 47:34.000
Come back!

47:34.083 --> 47:37.208
You want her to be the newspaper headline?
Get in your room!

47:43.666 --> 47:44.500
Quick.

47:44.708 --> 47:46.166
-Ying!
-Hey!

47:46.583 --> 47:47.833
Taxi!

47:49.791 --> 47:51.083
Follow that taxi. Quick!

47:51.791 --> 47:54.625
Hey, stop! We haven't gotten in!

48:00.666 --> 48:01.791
Step on it!

48:01.875 --> 48:03.083
Driver! Go faster!

48:03.458 --> 48:04.916
-Catch up with that taxi.
-Please...

48:05.000 --> 48:06.791
-Come on, faster.
-All right.

48:07.000 --> 48:08.375
Yes, it is that taxi in front.

48:08.458 --> 48:09.375
After it!

48:09.458 --> 48:12.208
-Overtake it!
-Why don't you go?

48:12.291 --> 48:13.125
What's wrong?

48:13.208 --> 48:14.500
-Why did you stop?
-Why did you stop?

48:14.583 --> 48:18.875
It's the red light.
My license is 11 points off.

48:18.958 --> 48:20.541
Do you want my license to be suspended?

48:20.625 --> 48:22.958
We are willing to pay for any penalty.

48:23.083 --> 48:25.458
Yes. If you could catch up,

48:25.625 --> 48:27.041
I'll give you an extra 100 dollars.

48:27.125 --> 48:30.750
-The license is mine, not yours.
-Sure.

48:31.416 --> 48:32.291
-Please!
-Please.

48:32.375 --> 48:33.916
Okay. Use your brain.

48:37.375 --> 48:40.791
Birdy calling Elephant.

48:42.500 --> 48:44.000
What is it, Birdy?

48:44.083 --> 48:48.125
Three passengers here request you

48:48.208 --> 48:49.083
to wait for them.

48:49.166 --> 48:51.083
Wait! Who are they?

48:51.291 --> 48:53.291
Tell him, we want our baby's mother.

48:53.375 --> 48:54.416
So could you help us?

48:54.500 --> 48:59.458
They want their baby's mother.
Could you help them?

48:59.541 --> 49:00.625
Thanks.

49:04.500 --> 49:06.500
She shakes her head.

49:06.583 --> 49:07.541
How did it go?

49:07.666 --> 49:09.541
She shook her head.

49:09.958 --> 49:11.458
Tell her this.

49:11.708 --> 49:14.833
Ying, we didn't do it
on purpose that night.

49:16.750 --> 49:22.041
Ying, he said they didn't do it on purpose
that night.

49:22.500 --> 49:26.916
Tell her I love her till heavens rot.

49:28.833 --> 49:34.416
He loves you till... vens... rot.

49:35.166 --> 49:37.250
What? "Vens rot"?

49:38.791 --> 49:42.041
Miss, this one with rotten organs

49:42.125 --> 49:44.375
must be a rascal. Give him up.

49:44.458 --> 49:47.333
The rotten organs guy, shut up! Next!

49:48.125 --> 49:50.333
Tell her that l, Puddin Lai,

49:50.625 --> 49:54.500
promise to stop smoking, gambling,
and splurging to care for my wife!

49:55.916 --> 50:00.750
He said, he would smoke... gamble...
splurge... no care for his wife!

50:02.625 --> 50:04.333
This one is rotten too.

50:04.541 --> 50:07.083
Unwilling to give up smoking.

50:07.166 --> 50:09.416
And what good husband splurges money?
Give him up.

50:10.291 --> 50:11.125
Next one!

50:11.875 --> 50:13.541
Let me talk! Ying.

50:13.833 --> 50:15.000
Hey, it's my turn.

50:15.666 --> 50:17.416
Ying.

50:18.666 --> 50:20.416
l am not a good speaker,

50:21.583 --> 50:23.041
I think you're so stupid!

50:24.458 --> 50:25.958
What does a woman need?

50:26.500 --> 50:28.375
A man who loves her for life.

50:29.291 --> 50:31.458
Now, there are three men who do.

50:32.166 --> 50:33.333
Calm down and think about it.

50:35.750 --> 50:37.083
Now you're alone,

50:37.166 --> 50:39.250
homeless, uncared for.

50:41.541 --> 50:43.708
Let us find you a somewhere nice to stay

50:43.958 --> 50:45.208
until you give birth.

50:45.666 --> 50:47.083
Once they verify who the father is,

50:48.333 --> 50:50.583
one of us will care for you for life.

50:53.000 --> 50:53.916
Let me.

50:55.500 --> 50:57.833
Elephant, stop your car.

50:57.916 --> 51:00.041
Let them meet.

51:00.708 --> 51:02.541
Wait for the three rascals?

51:02.625 --> 51:04.125
You must be out of your mind.

51:04.458 --> 51:06.166
Not knowing how to drive,
then don't be a driver.

51:06.583 --> 51:07.666
Oh, no!

51:14.875 --> 51:19.625
The three are really nice guys.

51:19.875 --> 51:23.250
You are in luck.
To hell with my driver's license!

51:23.333 --> 51:24.375
Bravo!

51:27.875 --> 51:29.458
I want to get down.

51:29.833 --> 51:30.916
No way!

51:31.000 --> 51:32.875
For your future's sake,
l won't let them get you.

51:32.958 --> 51:35.708
Hey! Let me out!

51:37.791 --> 51:38.916
-I can't find them!
-Yes.

51:39.000 --> 51:40.250
-What can we do?
-What can we do?

51:40.750 --> 51:43.125
Elephant, tell me your position!

51:43.208 --> 51:45.125
l can overtake you.

51:45.625 --> 51:47.625
l was in Prince Road when you asked.

51:47.708 --> 51:49.625
Now, l am off to Lung Cheong Road.

51:50.916 --> 51:51.916
Try and get me!

51:56.875 --> 51:59.541
What do you want? Let me out!

52:01.833 --> 52:02.875
Let them hit me.

52:02.958 --> 52:04.541
l won't allow them to catch you.

52:20.958 --> 52:22.166
Help!

52:22.250 --> 52:24.750
I won't let those bastards get in our way!

52:24.833 --> 52:26.583
Come out, you bastards!

52:30.375 --> 52:31.458
Come out!

52:32.708 --> 52:35.083
Ying, don't go away!

52:35.166 --> 52:37.833
Get up, you bastard!

52:38.916 --> 52:39.791
Get up.

52:41.333 --> 52:43.166
Ying, are you all right?

52:43.250 --> 52:45.083
-Are you all right?
-Are you all right?

52:46.625 --> 52:48.958
Ying, you are really gorgeous!

52:49.416 --> 52:52.708
You guys were pretty great.
It was worth risking my license.

52:53.000 --> 52:55.125
-Shut up!
-Shut up!

52:55.208 --> 52:56.041
Elephant.

52:58.833 --> 53:01.208
-Ying...
-Elephant, get up.

53:01.291 --> 53:03.125
-Serves him right!
-All covered in shit.

53:03.208 --> 53:05.625
Ying, what we just said in the taxi,

53:05.875 --> 53:06.833
do you agree?

53:07.375 --> 53:09.750
-We do mean it.
-Yes!

53:09.958 --> 53:11.083
Are you okay with it, Ying?

53:12.291 --> 53:13.625
Wow! Great!

53:18.750 --> 53:20.375
This place is a bit small.

53:21.041 --> 53:23.416
But, for one person,
l hope it is okay, right?

53:23.583 --> 53:24.625
Yes.

53:24.791 --> 53:26.666
Ying, forget anything else.

53:26.750 --> 53:28.125
Just concentrate on baby-making.

53:29.125 --> 53:30.666
What do you take her for?
How to make babies?

53:30.750 --> 53:31.958
With whom?

53:32.041 --> 53:34.625
Ying, l studied this place,

53:34.708 --> 53:35.916
the feng shui here is pretty good.

53:36.000 --> 53:37.333
This home will bring you riches,

53:37.416 --> 53:40.125
food, clothing, and many children.

53:46.000 --> 53:47.041
Cute, isn't it?

53:48.291 --> 53:49.291
Be careful.

53:51.291 --> 53:52.291
What is it?

53:52.375 --> 53:54.000
You really pissed me off this time.

53:54.416 --> 53:56.166
-It's just prenatal education.
-Prenatal education?

53:56.250 --> 53:57.625
Don't you like to have a cute baby?

53:57.833 --> 54:00.000
You call this thing a cute baby?

54:00.125 --> 54:02.875
I call it a freak!

54:03.000 --> 54:04.833
You are cute?

54:08.250 --> 54:09.291
It's just the plane.

54:09.791 --> 54:11.541
Look at you.

54:11.625 --> 54:13.541
l can't pass the days in peace.

54:25.625 --> 54:26.750
Guys!

54:27.666 --> 54:29.291
Till death do us part!

54:30.458 --> 54:31.875
Nothing can tear us apart!

54:34.500 --> 54:38.500
EUNUCH ON DUTY
PUDDIN LAI

54:42.541 --> 54:48.375
They are a lovely couple

54:52.125 --> 54:56.833
Who want to stay together forever

54:56.958 --> 55:00.416
But they have to be separated

55:02.333 --> 55:04.500
No exotic delicacy in this world

55:04.583 --> 55:07.291
could stand up to a decent dish
of celery with chicken.

55:07.958 --> 55:09.791
ls this celery?

55:10.333 --> 55:14.333
Of course. Here, try some, Ying.

55:14.625 --> 55:17.375
For celery, we eat the stem,
not the leaves.

55:18.333 --> 55:19.250
Shame on you!

55:20.041 --> 55:21.083
You lost face!

55:21.375 --> 55:24.958
Oh, boy. Look at how lush it is.

55:25.083 --> 55:26.291
It makes your mouth water.

55:30.291 --> 55:32.500
Should we save the best for last?

55:33.375 --> 55:35.833
Ying, here. Have some.

55:36.125 --> 55:37.125
Have a spare rib.

55:37.833 --> 55:40.000
You guys don't know nuts about delicacies.

55:42.291 --> 55:45.750
Even for the best things, just a little
is enough to fill your tummy.

55:48.000 --> 55:50.583
And since Ying gave it to me,
I'll take it.

55:52.625 --> 55:53.458
Happy.

55:55.625 --> 55:56.583
Everybody's happy!

56:00.416 --> 56:02.833
EUNUCH ON DUTY
BIG EYE

56:02.916 --> 56:03.958
I've got to marinate it.

56:13.791 --> 56:14.833
Vegetables in.

56:34.083 --> 56:34.958
It's all scorched!

56:40.125 --> 56:41.583
The less you take, the better it tastes.

56:57.208 --> 56:58.041
Where is it?

57:23.250 --> 57:24.458
-What is this?
-What is this?

57:24.833 --> 57:25.708
A fish!

57:26.916 --> 57:27.916
It's hard as a rock.

57:28.000 --> 57:29.041
Is it petrified?

57:29.291 --> 57:30.541
It's fresh.

57:31.083 --> 57:32.916
And it's edible.

57:33.000 --> 57:34.833
See, Ying says it is edible.

57:35.666 --> 57:37.500
What? Won't you eat?

57:38.375 --> 57:40.083
Ying tells us to eat, so go ahead.

57:40.166 --> 57:41.666
I would still eat it
even if it's dog shit.

57:42.416 --> 57:45.708
Don't, it is polluted.

57:46.250 --> 57:48.958
Nowadays,
sea water everywhere is polluted.

57:49.041 --> 57:50.833
So what's the point of worrying?

57:50.916 --> 57:53.250
Don't eat it. Have some vegetables.

57:54.666 --> 57:56.333
Is something wrong with the fish? Tell me!

57:56.416 --> 57:57.416
What are you afraid of?

57:57.500 --> 57:59.250
You think we picked it out
of the trash can?

58:00.250 --> 58:02.375
Bingo, that's the correct answer!

58:03.041 --> 58:05.041
You didn't stop me when you see me eat it!

58:05.125 --> 58:06.625
You raised the issue yourself, okay?

58:06.708 --> 58:08.166
Even dog shit is good.

58:09.125 --> 58:09.958
Right, Ying?

58:11.166 --> 58:13.791
EUNUCH ON DUTY
HAPPY

58:50.916 --> 58:52.541
Gourmet's delight!

58:57.750 --> 59:00.833
Pig's belly with bean curd soup
is good for your skin.

59:01.750 --> 59:03.416
-Tastes good.
-It does?

59:06.000 --> 59:07.291
But don't gobble it up.

59:11.041 --> 59:11.875
It's bitter!

59:11.958 --> 59:12.916
It's sour!

59:14.000 --> 59:16.583
For goodness sake, don't waste it!

59:19.708 --> 59:21.500
Do you know the difference
between smart and stupid?

59:22.458 --> 59:24.958
Stupid serves you celery leaves,

59:25.833 --> 59:27.416
and it makes us vomit.

59:28.958 --> 59:29.916
What's so funny?

59:30.916 --> 59:33.708
While smart serves you pig's belly,

59:34.375 --> 59:38.666
and it earns our praise.

59:45.166 --> 59:46.166
Look what he added.

59:53.625 --> 59:56.166
That will surely give him a stomachache!

59:56.250 --> 59:58.833
Ying, don't touch that soup.
Don't drink it.

59:58.916 --> 01:00:01.250
Eat something else.

01:00:01.333 --> 01:00:02.250
Here's a pork shoulder.

01:00:35.500 --> 01:00:39.916
Ying, did l do something wrong?

01:00:41.916 --> 01:00:46.458
Sorry, I'm too stupid to take care of you.

01:00:50.333 --> 01:00:51.291
No,

01:00:54.166 --> 01:00:56.000
I miss my family!

01:01:00.791 --> 01:01:05.166
Don't be sad. When the baby is born,

01:01:06.000 --> 01:01:07.708
we will happily meet them again.

01:01:10.333 --> 01:01:11.708
You are so kind.

01:01:12.291 --> 01:01:14.916
Am I the kindest of all three?

01:01:16.833 --> 01:01:18.208
All three of you...

01:01:26.583 --> 01:01:30.458
No, don't! We still don't know
who the father is.

01:01:30.833 --> 01:01:32.333
So please.

01:01:32.875 --> 01:01:35.166
Okay. I'm sorry.

01:01:58.208 --> 01:01:59.041
What's wrong?

01:01:59.583 --> 01:02:01.583
Oh, no. I didn't bring tissue paper!

01:02:02.250 --> 01:02:03.583
l have some.

01:02:04.000 --> 01:02:04.958
Yes. l...

01:02:06.458 --> 01:02:07.750
Here...

01:02:10.250 --> 01:02:11.083
Are you all right?

01:02:11.458 --> 01:02:13.916
Sorry, l ruined your shirt.

01:02:14.250 --> 01:02:15.625
I'll clean it for you.

01:02:15.958 --> 01:02:17.000
It's all right.

01:02:23.791 --> 01:02:27.625
Come on, let it out.

01:02:40.666 --> 01:02:42.458
Wait!

01:02:43.166 --> 01:02:44.791
Wait!

01:02:47.333 --> 01:02:49.083
No more.

01:02:50.416 --> 01:02:51.416
Then, l get nothing?

01:02:51.541 --> 01:02:54.375
It's okay. If you want to throw up,
just do it.

01:02:58.458 --> 01:02:59.625
Thank you.

01:03:07.041 --> 01:03:08.958
Can l keep the clothes now?

01:03:09.875 --> 01:03:11.791
Be careful.

01:03:16.083 --> 01:03:19.333
Are you kidding me? Why do these three
stooges show up like this?

01:03:19.416 --> 01:03:21.833
-Is this your first time here?
-Yes.

01:03:22.333 --> 01:03:23.791
What's the father's name?

01:03:27.125 --> 01:03:29.166
-Mr. X.
-Mr. X?

01:03:34.458 --> 01:03:36.833
Mr. X, whatever.

01:03:43.416 --> 01:03:46.666
Miss, your father is here!

01:03:48.458 --> 01:03:49.291
Dad.

01:03:50.916 --> 01:03:51.875
-Sir!
-Sir!

01:03:54.125 --> 01:03:55.500
-Dad.
-Sir.

01:03:56.125 --> 01:03:58.708
We haven't seen you for two months.
Where have you been?

01:03:58.958 --> 01:04:00.416
They must have been to boarding school.

01:04:01.208 --> 01:04:03.083
Boarding school?

01:04:03.416 --> 01:04:05.791
You three, come with me.

01:04:13.833 --> 01:04:14.666
Get in.

01:04:22.166 --> 01:04:24.458
It's hot out here.
We better get in the shade.

01:04:25.791 --> 01:04:26.833
-Hello, sir!
-Hello, sir!

01:04:27.166 --> 01:04:28.583
Sir, did you call us

01:04:28.750 --> 01:04:30.500
just so you can hand us to the cops?

01:04:34.750 --> 01:04:36.000
You bastards shut up!

01:04:36.708 --> 01:04:38.375
We're not done with this yet.

01:04:38.958 --> 01:04:40.541
l don't want a scandal.

01:04:41.166 --> 01:04:44.208
Be careful! Don't let him find out.

01:04:48.083 --> 01:04:50.333
You all better chuckle.

01:04:54.250 --> 01:04:55.875
Sir, what are you up to?

01:04:55.958 --> 01:04:58.625
Now, Ying refused to abort it.

01:04:59.083 --> 01:05:01.125
That means she has to marry one of you.

01:05:01.708 --> 01:05:05.458
The lucky man has to pay me
half a million US dollars.

01:05:05.666 --> 01:05:07.166
Not a cent less.

01:05:12.791 --> 01:05:13.958
Your dad has changed.

01:05:14.083 --> 01:05:16.208
-He's so friendly to the three.
-Yes!

01:05:18.708 --> 01:05:21.083
We're all family, so could you give us
an 80% discount?

01:05:21.500 --> 01:05:26.500
Shut up! Money is real,
kinship is bullshit.

01:05:27.083 --> 01:05:29.500
I want 60 tables at the wedding banquet

01:05:29.583 --> 01:05:30.708
and one apartment,

01:05:30.791 --> 01:05:33.500
only 1,300 square feet is fine.

01:05:35.250 --> 01:05:39.041
Make it look like
we're having a good time.

01:05:45.166 --> 01:05:46.500
That was really funny.

01:05:47.458 --> 01:05:48.291
Dad!

01:05:50.666 --> 01:05:52.333
Dad, can we go home now?

01:05:52.875 --> 01:05:55.083
Ying, you can't go home.

01:05:55.500 --> 01:05:58.958
You have so much homework to do,
and you're graduating in seven months.

01:05:59.416 --> 01:06:01.583
So you've got to work hard.

01:06:01.916 --> 01:06:03.416
Fook, let's go home.

01:06:03.625 --> 01:06:05.375
Bye, sir.

01:06:05.458 --> 01:06:07.041
Let's chuckle again next time.

01:06:07.125 --> 01:06:08.291
We've got to pay half a million.

01:06:09.125 --> 01:06:10.083
Sixty tables.

01:06:10.375 --> 01:06:11.708
And 1,300 square feet.

01:06:13.583 --> 01:06:15.250
-Are you with me?
-Count me in!

01:06:16.291 --> 01:06:17.291
Count me in!

01:06:18.208 --> 01:06:20.458
Ying, we will work hard for you.

01:06:21.041 --> 01:06:22.958
Enough chatter, let's take her home.

01:06:23.041 --> 01:06:25.708
-Go, Ying.
-Let's go.

01:06:36.416 --> 01:06:40.458
It's all fated, you can't change it.

01:06:40.666 --> 01:06:41.791
PUDDIN LAI
FORTUNE TELLER

01:06:43.375 --> 01:06:44.208
Master Lai.

01:06:45.958 --> 01:06:47.416
Sit please.

01:06:49.208 --> 01:06:53.000
Sir, you have eyes as powerful as a tiger,
and it's like a gold mine.

01:06:53.083 --> 01:06:54.833
Master Lai, do you remember me?

01:06:56.625 --> 01:06:59.875
Oh, Mr. Driver!

01:06:59.958 --> 01:07:02.041
You escaped an accident,
you're going to strike it rich.

01:07:02.125 --> 01:07:04.916
Let me give you advice
on how to make a big fortune.

01:07:05.000 --> 01:07:07.125
That is fine. l take you as a living god.

01:07:07.208 --> 01:07:08.250
Good.

01:07:09.083 --> 01:07:11.541
But, Master Lai, you told me
you didn't have a workplace.

01:07:13.208 --> 01:07:15.583
But l have a wife and a child now.

01:07:15.666 --> 01:07:17.666
Let's go back to you.

01:07:19.291 --> 01:07:23.083
-Your brow is like the glowing sun.
-Yes?

01:07:23.333 --> 01:07:24.875
But there is a tinge of black cloud.

01:07:25.166 --> 01:07:27.083
You can't wipe it off that way.

01:07:27.750 --> 01:07:30.416
I believe that times
are tough for you lately.

01:07:31.291 --> 01:07:34.000
Exactly! Master Lai, you're a living god.

01:07:34.083 --> 01:07:35.416
-Let me see your palm.
-Sure.

01:07:35.541 --> 01:07:37.083
You've been working so hard
behind the wheel.

01:07:37.666 --> 01:07:38.500
Yes!

01:07:38.708 --> 01:07:39.833
Besides that...

01:07:42.791 --> 01:07:44.541
You should buy some real estate!

01:07:45.541 --> 01:07:48.166
Master Lai, you're truly divine!

01:07:49.541 --> 01:07:51.791
I have a lot of competition recently.

01:07:51.875 --> 01:07:53.000
So what would you like to buy?

01:07:53.083 --> 01:07:54.208
Connaught Centre.

01:07:54.500 --> 01:07:57.583
Good choice!
Commercial unit, stable returns!

01:07:58.166 --> 01:08:01.041
Not just one unit, but the whole block!

01:08:02.916 --> 01:08:05.166
The first time l saw you,

01:08:05.250 --> 01:08:07.125
l knew the sky is your limit.

01:08:07.208 --> 01:08:09.708
You have a face of nobility.

01:08:09.791 --> 01:08:12.541
l give you a set of talismans. Remember.

01:08:12.750 --> 01:08:15.208
Put one on your chest, one on your bed,

01:08:15.291 --> 01:08:18.583
one under the bed,
don't wet it even in the bath.

01:08:18.916 --> 01:08:20.875
When wet, it loses its power.
Three days later,

01:08:20.958 --> 01:08:22.916
whoever tries to compete with you
will be wiped out.

01:08:24.833 --> 01:08:26.375
-Chiu!
-Yes!

01:08:27.791 --> 01:08:29.458
Five thousand dollars for Master Lai.

01:08:30.625 --> 01:08:31.791
He's my secretary.

01:08:31.875 --> 01:08:33.083
Thank you.

01:08:33.750 --> 01:08:35.083
Thanks, Mr. Chiu.

01:08:35.375 --> 01:08:37.041
It's not every day I see a face like that.

01:08:37.125 --> 01:08:38.750
Would you like me to read your face?

01:08:56.666 --> 01:08:58.833
Ho Yan, are you making a pair of pants
or a gunny sack?

01:08:58.916 --> 01:09:01.041
Sorry, I'll do it again.

01:09:02.083 --> 01:09:05.125
Do it right, I need it
by tomorrow morning.

01:09:05.208 --> 01:09:06.583
-Got it?
-Got it.

01:09:09.208 --> 01:09:12.083
Ho Yan, why are you working so hard?

01:09:14.541 --> 01:09:15.750
I want to get married.

01:09:15.833 --> 01:09:20.208
Oh, you want to pick up a girl?

01:09:21.666 --> 01:09:23.000
Soon enough, you will get a child.

01:09:24.208 --> 01:09:29.291
Who knows, maybe you will have
more than one child.

01:09:30.416 --> 01:09:31.375
Who knows?

01:09:32.750 --> 01:09:35.916
You know, you're like a black man
in a black forest.

01:09:37.083 --> 01:09:38.125
What do you mean?

01:09:38.375 --> 01:09:40.708
You're all in the dark.

01:09:46.875 --> 01:09:50.000
How's this? Is it good? Thanks for coming.

01:09:56.666 --> 01:09:58.541
Sorry, miss, we are closing.

01:09:58.625 --> 01:10:01.041
-Why not do my hair first?
-Boss!

01:10:01.458 --> 01:10:02.458
Can I help you?

01:10:02.541 --> 01:10:04.875
Step in please.

01:10:05.541 --> 01:10:07.666
Sir, let me do one more.

01:10:07.958 --> 01:10:08.875
Okay.

01:10:10.250 --> 01:10:11.375
Thank you, sir.

01:10:12.041 --> 01:10:13.375
I'm going to toil again!

01:10:13.458 --> 01:10:14.375
Sit please.

01:10:14.458 --> 01:10:16.583
Happy, you're working hard?

01:10:17.291 --> 01:10:19.666
I can't help it.
l have to feed the family.

01:10:19.750 --> 01:10:22.041
-I don't mind losing two hours of sleep.
-You're really something!

01:10:23.166 --> 01:10:24.125
What cut would you like?

01:10:24.208 --> 01:10:25.666
A bit shorter.

01:10:26.958 --> 01:10:28.458
-Happy!
-Happy!

01:10:32.125 --> 01:10:33.458
So, you changed salons.

01:10:33.625 --> 01:10:35.541
-Let me kiss you!
-Let me kiss you!

01:10:38.583 --> 01:10:41.666
Stop! Boss, three more jobs, please.

01:10:42.833 --> 01:10:44.791
-We know what to do.
-We know what to do.

01:10:45.041 --> 01:10:47.750
-Sit.
-Come on.

01:10:49.583 --> 01:10:51.791
-How long do I have to wait?
-Make mine first.

01:11:20.166 --> 01:11:22.125
Why do you guys look so tired?

01:11:24.833 --> 01:11:26.625
No. I'm fine.

01:11:26.708 --> 01:11:27.833
I'm doing good.

01:11:28.125 --> 01:11:29.875
I got a heart of steel.

01:11:29.958 --> 01:11:33.958
We're so pumped up, we feel like sparring!

01:11:35.958 --> 01:11:38.375
EUNUCH ON DUTY

01:11:58.958 --> 01:11:59.833
Where is my towel?

01:12:12.791 --> 01:12:15.083
-This place looks nice, doesn't it?
-It does.

01:12:15.958 --> 01:12:18.083
Yes, we can get some fresh air here.

01:12:19.416 --> 01:12:21.208
-What's the matter?
-Ying, are you all right?

01:12:21.291 --> 01:12:22.125
Let me help you.

01:12:23.375 --> 01:12:26.041
-It's kicking me.
-My child is so mischievous.

01:12:27.125 --> 01:12:28.041
Slowly.

01:12:30.625 --> 01:12:32.625
Be good, my little one.

01:12:32.958 --> 01:12:35.041
In two more months,
you will come out and decide our fate.

01:12:35.125 --> 01:12:36.541
Hands off!

01:12:38.833 --> 01:12:41.041
And you're going to break the hearts

01:12:41.208 --> 01:12:42.583
of two men by then.

01:12:42.958 --> 01:12:46.375
Don't worry, I'll give you some glue

01:12:46.583 --> 01:12:47.583
to mend those hearts.

01:12:47.666 --> 01:12:49.375
Better to mend your head!

01:12:50.208 --> 01:12:52.666
ln fact, all three of you are gentlemen.

01:12:53.125 --> 01:12:55.416
You're hardworking, responsible,

01:12:55.833 --> 01:12:56.958
and capable.

01:12:58.458 --> 01:13:01.833
When l marry one of you,

01:13:02.083 --> 01:13:05.916
will the three of you
still be good friends?

01:13:06.916 --> 01:13:08.583
We've been together for so long.

01:13:08.666 --> 01:13:10.416
Aren't we good friends all along?

01:13:10.500 --> 01:13:12.458
Yes, we truly are.

01:13:14.333 --> 01:13:15.291
Up yours!

01:13:18.041 --> 01:13:22.250
-It's just a dog, okay?
-Just ignore it.

01:13:22.583 --> 01:13:24.708
Can't you be a little humane?

01:13:25.583 --> 01:13:27.666
Ying, you know what he is like.

01:13:28.000 --> 01:13:35.000
AUNTIE HO'S MATERNITY HOME

01:13:39.291 --> 01:13:41.166
Old man, l am nervous.

01:13:41.250 --> 01:13:43.333
My hands are freezing!

01:13:44.375 --> 01:13:46.125
Congratulations,
you're going to have a grandchild.

01:13:46.541 --> 01:13:48.625
Why so tense, sit down.

01:13:56.833 --> 01:13:59.125
You're here, Mom, Dad, godfather.

01:14:00.041 --> 01:14:01.375
My in-laws are here.

01:14:03.083 --> 01:14:04.833
Stop! I don't want to hear that.

01:14:04.916 --> 01:14:07.000
My grandchild
doesn't have three fathers. Go!

01:14:07.375 --> 01:14:10.666
Get lost! Or else, I'll hack you to pieces

01:14:11.000 --> 01:14:12.083
and feed you to the dogs.

01:14:12.375 --> 01:14:15.750
All right. Go home first!

01:14:17.416 --> 01:14:18.416
Go!

01:14:18.500 --> 01:14:20.750
Wait! Put those down.

01:14:23.416 --> 01:14:24.250
Go now.

01:14:26.916 --> 01:14:27.833
Ma'am!

01:14:29.541 --> 01:14:30.375
What?

01:14:30.458 --> 01:14:33.375
This is my blood type.

01:14:33.583 --> 01:14:35.166
If it is proven that the baby is mine,

01:14:35.458 --> 01:14:37.375
I'll buy you a big present.

01:14:37.458 --> 01:14:40.916
Ma'am. If it is mine,
I'll kneel and serve you tea.

01:14:42.458 --> 01:14:45.750
-This is solid proof of my paternity.
-Ma'am!

01:14:45.833 --> 01:14:47.833
Stop fooling around already, go!

01:14:48.416 --> 01:14:50.791
-Go away!
-Ma'am.

01:14:54.208 --> 01:14:55.041
Hey.

01:14:55.125 --> 01:14:57.041
How many blood types are there?

01:14:57.125 --> 01:14:59.791
Two. Male and female.

01:14:59.916 --> 01:15:01.541
So which one is male
and which one is female?

01:15:01.625 --> 01:15:03.916
It's all in English.

01:15:04.791 --> 01:15:05.625
What does it say?

01:15:10.000 --> 01:15:12.583
This is odd, they are all type A!

01:15:24.041 --> 01:15:27.208
Give me a sign!

01:15:28.208 --> 01:15:29.416
I'm sure it will be a boy.

01:15:29.666 --> 01:15:31.000
I think so too.

01:15:31.083 --> 01:15:32.291
It's uncertain.

01:15:33.375 --> 01:15:35.875
Thanks for taking care of Ying so far,

01:15:36.125 --> 01:15:37.791
how about giving my child a name?

01:15:37.875 --> 01:15:39.375
-You're dreaming.
-Have some wit.

01:15:40.416 --> 01:15:41.500
How about Plum Lai.

01:15:42.833 --> 01:15:43.833
Plum stone.

01:15:45.166 --> 01:15:46.041
Ma'am!

01:15:46.125 --> 01:15:47.166
She's here.

01:15:47.250 --> 01:15:48.166
Is it a boy or girl.

01:15:48.250 --> 01:15:49.541
What is it?

01:15:49.625 --> 01:15:51.708
-Does it look like me?
-Ma'am.

01:15:51.791 --> 01:15:53.083
Of the same blood type?

01:15:53.583 --> 01:15:54.416
Ma'am, tell us.

01:15:54.500 --> 01:15:57.250
Ma'am, tell us, please.
Is it a boy or a girl?

01:15:57.333 --> 01:15:58.458
It's a boy.

01:15:58.541 --> 01:16:01.375
-Wow, Great. l knew it!
-It's a boy!

01:16:01.458 --> 01:16:04.000
But he's an illegitimate son.
Dad sold him to his godfather.

01:16:04.083 --> 01:16:05.333
-He sold my son?
-He sold my son?

01:16:05.416 --> 01:16:07.500
And he's taking him to Canada tomorrow.

01:16:07.583 --> 01:16:08.541
Hey, give him back to me!

01:16:08.625 --> 01:16:11.166
They don't call him godfather for nothing.
He's rich and powerful!

01:16:11.250 --> 01:16:13.166
-Don't even think of taking that boy!
-Ma'am!

01:16:13.250 --> 01:16:14.083
Move it!

01:16:15.250 --> 01:16:16.458
-Ma'am!
-Ma'am!

01:16:19.666 --> 01:16:20.500
What now?

01:16:21.166 --> 01:16:23.375
We must stick together for once.

01:16:23.541 --> 01:16:24.458
Okay.

01:16:25.375 --> 01:16:26.833
-Let's unite!
-Let's unite!

01:16:29.875 --> 01:16:31.250
Dumbass.

01:16:41.791 --> 01:16:42.625
Come on.

01:16:49.500 --> 01:16:52.958
Kid, I got you some milk. Where are you?

01:16:53.041 --> 01:16:55.666
This is an auspicious direction,
I'm sure of it.

01:16:57.291 --> 01:16:59.083
-But it's a wall.
-Yes.

01:16:59.583 --> 01:17:02.000
Enough talk, let's climb.

01:17:02.083 --> 01:17:03.333
-Right.
-Yes.

01:17:05.083 --> 01:17:05.916
Go on.

01:17:09.583 --> 01:17:13.000
You've caused so much trouble today.
Bad dog, now go out!

01:17:19.041 --> 01:17:20.000
Run quickly.

01:17:33.416 --> 01:17:38.833
Where are you, son? Daddy's here.

01:17:39.916 --> 01:17:42.333
-Big eye boy.
-Big nose boy.

01:17:42.416 --> 01:17:43.750
This way's northwest.

01:17:43.833 --> 01:17:44.666
Let's go.

01:17:46.791 --> 01:17:47.958
Big eye boy.

01:17:50.250 --> 01:17:51.250
-Big eye boy.
-Big nose boy.

01:17:51.333 --> 01:17:52.500
-I'm coming!
-Hey.

01:17:53.000 --> 01:17:56.125
You think you can fly up there?
Can't you find a path first?

01:17:58.791 --> 01:18:01.791
Southeast? That's weird.

01:18:03.916 --> 01:18:06.333
l was right!

01:18:06.666 --> 01:18:08.416
Little Puddin, here l come.

01:18:18.583 --> 01:18:20.791
Good baby, nice baby.

01:18:21.250 --> 01:18:24.125
You're going to fly tomorrow,
so you better be good.

01:18:24.958 --> 01:18:27.041
-Be good.
-The sun is smiling bright

01:18:27.208 --> 01:18:30.416
Everyone is incredibly happy!

01:18:43.458 --> 01:18:46.458
Inspiration and IQ are excellent

01:18:46.541 --> 01:18:49.500
My originality
And imagination may scare you

01:18:49.958 --> 01:18:53.250
Both Wan and Gat are equally important

01:18:53.333 --> 01:18:55.916
You'll see me happily...

01:18:56.833 --> 01:18:58.916
Smiling at the sky

01:18:59.000 --> 01:19:00.583
"Here comes Mr. Piggy!"

01:19:02.916 --> 01:19:05.583
"It's a wonderful morning
in Penguin Village."

01:19:07.083 --> 01:19:09.083
But something big is happening.

01:19:09.166 --> 01:19:11.583
A four-eyed monster is causing trouble.

01:19:12.416 --> 01:19:13.833
I didn't do it on purpose!

01:19:18.791 --> 01:19:20.791
I was kidding. Don't be so serious.

01:19:25.291 --> 01:19:27.583
Don't be nosy. Go to bed.

01:19:32.625 --> 01:19:36.166
"I'm Dr. Slump, and I'm dying."

01:19:37.041 --> 01:19:38.833
"Gatchan is here!"

01:19:38.916 --> 01:19:40.750
"By the power of Grayskull!"

01:19:40.833 --> 01:19:41.833
Stop it!

01:19:42.916 --> 01:19:44.208
Run.

01:19:46.708 --> 01:19:47.666
He-man?

01:19:48.083 --> 01:19:50.208
Go inside! You're making things worse!

01:19:54.041 --> 01:19:56.125
Dr. Slump, you were electrocuted?

01:19:56.208 --> 01:19:58.416
Of course, I nearly fainted.

01:20:00.416 --> 01:20:02.958
-"Boo-bee."
-"Boo-bee."

01:20:03.875 --> 01:20:04.791
What's the matter?

01:20:04.875 --> 01:20:08.041
Ms. Yamabuki could see you
in her mirror, you fool!

01:20:10.041 --> 01:20:11.500
When we eat pickled plum...

01:20:11.625 --> 01:20:12.875
We will become Superman!

01:20:12.958 --> 01:20:15.333
-We're going to fly.
-Yes!

01:20:17.875 --> 01:20:20.416
Superman, going up.

01:20:24.750 --> 01:20:26.750
Superman, you crashed again.

01:20:31.208 --> 01:20:34.250
Superman, come back here.

01:20:34.458 --> 01:20:38.416
This way, quick.

01:20:39.125 --> 01:20:42.250
Not that way, this way.

01:20:43.125 --> 01:20:45.458
Get him to sleep first, Gatchan!

01:20:46.041 --> 01:20:48.000
"Boo-bee."

01:20:56.125 --> 01:20:57.875
Doctor, Superman is asleep.

01:20:57.958 --> 01:21:00.375
You may carry on with your research.

01:21:05.916 --> 01:21:10.041
Resuscitate him, even if it's gross!

01:21:16.333 --> 01:21:17.375
The phone is ringing.

01:21:19.541 --> 01:21:23.791
The whole village is asleep now.
Call back tomorrow.

01:21:24.291 --> 01:21:26.458
What bad timing!

01:21:29.458 --> 01:21:34.791
I'll take it. Everyone's trying to
sleep here! What a bother.

01:21:40.583 --> 01:21:43.125
Where's the baby?

01:21:43.208 --> 01:21:47.083
Not "baby," it's "boo-bee"!
Superman is awake!

01:21:47.166 --> 01:21:49.833
We can play again now. Come on.

01:21:52.250 --> 01:21:53.750
"Boo-bee."

01:22:27.833 --> 01:22:29.041
Still awake?

01:22:43.916 --> 01:22:47.458
Hi, pretty, hold on a minute.

01:22:50.750 --> 01:22:51.583
Want to kiss?

01:22:52.250 --> 01:22:53.333
Kiss this!

01:22:56.958 --> 01:22:57.916
Let me do it.

01:23:05.625 --> 01:23:06.958
I've got to ward off some evil.

01:23:10.083 --> 01:23:11.083
There's more.

01:23:11.916 --> 01:23:13.041
So pretty!

01:23:15.125 --> 01:23:17.083
-Pass to me.
-You're the pretty one!

01:23:18.041 --> 01:23:20.291
Stop!

01:23:23.375 --> 01:23:24.333
Let go!

01:23:24.416 --> 01:23:26.458
-Give me back my son!
-Thank you!

01:23:26.666 --> 01:23:27.666
My son!

01:23:28.250 --> 01:23:31.083
l am done for. Take care of my son.

01:23:35.333 --> 01:23:36.208
Arrest them all.

01:23:39.666 --> 01:23:41.083
Son!

01:23:43.208 --> 01:23:44.333
Give it back!

01:23:45.041 --> 01:23:46.166
Give it back!

01:23:50.666 --> 01:23:54.916
-Son!
-Son!

01:23:55.083 --> 01:24:02.041
-Keung! Rush the baby to the hospital.
-What is it?

01:24:02.125 --> 01:24:05.208
-Quick.
-Quick.

01:24:05.375 --> 01:24:07.083
Go to the hospital!

01:24:09.916 --> 01:24:10.833
Miss...

01:24:14.291 --> 01:24:16.875
Ying, come quickly to Baptist Hospital.

01:24:17.041 --> 01:24:19.208
I'll tell you everything later. Hurry!

01:24:22.208 --> 01:24:25.583
-If anything happens to my son, you--
-Your son?

01:24:27.166 --> 01:24:28.708
He is my flesh and blood.

01:24:29.750 --> 01:24:31.375
l bought him.

01:24:31.666 --> 01:24:34.250
I signed it with my lawyer,
so the kid is mine!

01:24:34.333 --> 01:24:35.375
You...

01:24:37.625 --> 01:24:39.166
You're rich, so what?

01:24:39.791 --> 01:24:40.916
The doctor's here.

01:24:42.000 --> 01:24:43.583
How is it?

01:24:43.916 --> 01:24:45.791
The baby is suffering from
a serious concussion.

01:24:45.875 --> 01:24:47.333
We have to operate him at once.

01:24:47.500 --> 01:24:49.000
Who's the father here? Please sign.

01:24:49.083 --> 01:24:50.125
-I'll sign.
-Allow me.

01:24:50.791 --> 01:24:52.291
l am the legal father.

01:24:52.583 --> 01:24:55.208
Even if the baby survives,
he will be mentally challenged.

01:24:55.416 --> 01:24:59.166
If he's a retard, then this is
his real father! Now sign!

01:25:00.666 --> 01:25:03.791
My son's a retard now. What can I do?

01:25:03.875 --> 01:25:05.833
-Let me sign.
-He will probably be a vegetable child.

01:25:06.458 --> 01:25:08.083
-l would like a cabbage.
-Vegetative.

01:25:10.666 --> 01:25:11.666
I'll sign.

01:25:11.958 --> 01:25:14.083
Dad and Mom will care for you

01:25:14.208 --> 01:25:16.125
and love you forever. Here, doctor.

01:25:18.375 --> 01:25:20.375
Why do you have to fight over everything?

01:25:20.458 --> 01:25:23.416
Have you thought it over?
You can't care for yourself.

01:25:27.166 --> 01:25:29.791
-My son... He's dead?
-He's dead?

01:25:31.416 --> 01:25:34.041
-Son!
-Ma'am!

01:25:40.166 --> 01:25:41.333
A doll!

01:25:41.875 --> 01:25:44.916
If it were real, we wouldn't have
let you get away with it!

01:25:45.000 --> 01:25:46.541
You think they would let you in?

01:25:47.833 --> 01:25:49.416
-Take it back.
-Where is my son then?

01:25:53.416 --> 01:25:54.500
-Ying!
-Son!

01:25:56.041 --> 01:25:56.958
Son!

01:25:57.958 --> 01:25:58.958
Good boy.

01:25:59.041 --> 01:26:00.666
He looks just like me.

01:26:00.750 --> 01:26:01.583
Are you nuts?

01:26:02.083 --> 01:26:04.500
Sir, I've done my part now.

01:26:04.666 --> 01:26:07.375
I have to go back to work
before the chief finds out.

01:26:07.458 --> 01:26:08.625
He would fire me!

01:26:12.250 --> 01:26:14.041
So it's a prank on us.

01:26:14.125 --> 01:26:17.166
Not for fun. It's my plan to test you.

01:26:17.583 --> 01:26:19.583
You three love Ying the same,

01:26:19.666 --> 01:26:22.583
and you all have the same blood type,
type A.

01:26:22.666 --> 01:26:23.666
Queer type!

01:26:24.625 --> 01:26:25.750
-All type A?
-Big Eye,

01:26:25.833 --> 01:26:28.708
you are the kindest,

01:26:28.791 --> 01:26:31.208
so devoted to Ying. Marrying you,

01:26:31.291 --> 01:26:32.625
-make me feel secure.
-Really?

01:26:32.708 --> 01:26:34.541
-If you don't want, I'll take her anytime!
-Really?

01:26:34.625 --> 01:26:38.083
Not so fast! Until I get that one thousand
three hundred square foot apartment,

01:26:38.166 --> 01:26:40.375
sixty tables, and half a million dollars,

01:26:40.458 --> 01:26:41.833
you can meet only once a month.

01:26:41.916 --> 01:26:44.500
Shut up! I'm going to wed her next month.

01:26:44.833 --> 01:26:46.208
The number of tables doesn't matter.

01:26:46.291 --> 01:26:47.291
Really, ma'am?

01:26:48.291 --> 01:26:49.250
Hey.

01:26:49.333 --> 01:26:52.083
You got yourself a good son-in-law!
What else do you want?

01:26:52.166 --> 01:26:54.375
-No!
-Come with me.

01:27:01.333 --> 01:27:03.583
-Call me daddy.
-Say daddy.

01:27:04.083 --> 01:27:08.041
Fate has brought them together.

01:27:08.916 --> 01:27:10.958
You struck it big this time, Big Eye.

01:27:13.375 --> 01:27:16.916
You two cheer up.
You're still good friends.

01:27:17.000 --> 01:27:18.583
Right! Of course.

01:27:19.250 --> 01:27:22.625
This is Chan and this is Puddin.

01:27:23.458 --> 01:27:24.916
Who does he look like?

01:27:27.125 --> 01:27:28.041
Such big nose, it looks--

01:27:28.125 --> 01:27:32.291
Hey! He looks like me.
Ying and I conceived him.

01:27:33.500 --> 01:27:36.458
Ying, we're going to make us
a squad of Big Eye boys.

01:27:36.833 --> 01:27:39.208
Can you do it?

01:27:39.375 --> 01:27:40.625
No problem.

01:27:57.541 --> 01:27:58.708
Done.

01:28:00.083 --> 01:28:01.833
-I want to cut your hair.
-No!

01:28:02.000 --> 01:28:03.166
Your turn.

01:28:03.250 --> 01:28:05.250
-Help!
-Don't run.

01:28:06.291 --> 01:28:08.416
-Daddy!
-Don't run!

01:28:08.666 --> 01:28:13.666
Daddy, he wants to cut my hair again.

01:28:13.958 --> 01:28:15.333
Don't bully your brother.

01:28:15.666 --> 01:28:16.666
They won't let me cut.

01:28:16.750 --> 01:28:18.958
The last time you cut my hair,
you left a bald patch on me!

01:28:19.041 --> 01:28:20.791
The whole school laughed at me
for three months.

01:28:20.875 --> 01:28:22.083
l am laughed at too.

01:28:22.250 --> 01:28:24.083
Laugh at you, why?

01:28:24.375 --> 01:28:27.041
My nose is big and my eyes are small,
l don't look like you.

01:28:27.291 --> 01:28:29.000
They say l look like Chan.

01:28:30.583 --> 01:28:33.208
Don't mind what people say,
you're my dear son.

01:28:33.625 --> 01:28:35.041
Daddy loves you the same.

01:28:36.041 --> 01:28:38.583
-Mommy.
-Come on, Grandpa's here.

01:28:38.750 --> 01:28:40.625
Young ones, come to Grandma.

01:28:40.708 --> 01:28:42.625
-Let Grandma hold you.
-Good girl.

01:28:42.708 --> 01:28:45.166
Come, give Grandma a kiss.

01:28:45.250 --> 01:28:47.375
Ying, Dad.

01:28:48.375 --> 01:28:49.333
Coffee please.

01:28:49.416 --> 01:28:51.666
Come here, Ying.

01:28:53.083 --> 01:28:54.791
What's the test result?

01:28:54.875 --> 01:28:56.291
You guess.

01:28:56.375 --> 01:28:58.916
No need to test.
Ying never disappoints you.

01:29:00.708 --> 01:29:03.125
We have another child!

01:29:05.916 --> 01:29:07.041
Long live Mommy!

01:29:08.875 --> 01:29:10.375
Ho Yan.

01:29:10.458 --> 01:29:13.541
Ying is having your sixth child.

01:29:13.833 --> 01:29:16.208
Bearing a child is really tough, you know?

01:29:16.708 --> 01:29:18.958
l know, that's why l love Ying so much.

01:29:19.041 --> 01:29:21.166
You should.

01:29:21.250 --> 01:29:22.666
Dad, you should be happy too.

01:29:22.750 --> 01:29:25.750
The apartment,
half a million, all delivered.

01:29:25.916 --> 01:29:28.083
l am happy. Not complaining at all.

01:29:28.458 --> 01:29:31.666
But, if there is a big yacht,

01:29:31.791 --> 01:29:35.875
-we can enjoy on the sea, right?
-Big yacht. No problem.

01:29:35.958 --> 01:29:36.875
You can afford it.

01:29:37.416 --> 01:29:40.166
How about buying a big yacht?

01:29:40.250 --> 01:29:41.416
-Good!
-Bravo!

01:29:42.000 --> 01:29:43.791
You're the best son-in-law.

01:29:43.875 --> 01:29:44.875
Thank you, Dad.

01:29:45.083 --> 01:29:46.250
Put it in my name.

01:29:48.083 --> 01:29:49.416
-Yours again?
-Mine again.
